<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">Thuhilkiana</book>
  <para style="h">Thuhilkiana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thuhilkiana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thuhilkiana</para>
  <para style="mt">Thuhilkiana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Moses in Jordan galkhat senel gam sung, Suph tawh a kigalsai, Paran le Tophel, Laban, Hazeroth, le Di-zahab kikala om Israel zosie tungah a na gen thute ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Kadesh-barnea pen Horeb panin Seir Muol tawnin ni sawm le ni khat kipei hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kum sawmlina, hla sawm le khatna a ni masa ni-in Topa in amate kungah gen dinga a thupieh bang lienin Moses in Israel-te a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam pen ama in Heshbon gam a uh Amor-te’ kumpipa Sihon, Ashtaroth, le Endrei gam a uh Bashan kumpipa Og a zaw zo cieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moab gam Jordan galkhat-ah Moses in tam thukham a hilcien hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Horeb muolah Topa i Pasien in eite ei hopi a, ‘Tami muolah na sawt op zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na khuolzin maban uh zomkia unlen Amor-te’ muoltung gam le a kima gamte zong- Arabah gam, muoltung gam, Shephelah gam, Negeb gam, le tuipi dung teng- Canaan-te’ gam le Lebanon gam, gun golpi ahi Euphrates dongin pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En un, na masang vuah leitang ka koi zo hi; pei unlen keima in na pu na pate uh Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, le a nua vua a suonlehlahte tungah pieh dinga ka kamciem leitang luo un,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in na kung vuah, “Na vai uh keima guoh in ka puo zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuni-in vana aasi za a pha dingin Topa na Pasien un ang pungsah zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa na pu na pate uh’ Pasien in a za tulin hing pungsah hinlen na tung vuah ang thuciemsa bangin thupha hing pie taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam bang na kiphinna uh vangihte kei guoh in bangci puoh zawh ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na minam sung ciet panun na makai dingun mipil, thuthei, le a zatahhuoi mite tel un,” kang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in, “Kote adingin na thugente hoi hi,” ci-in nei dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n na minam makaite uh ahi mipil le a kizatah mite ka la a, na tung vuah a tul uh, a za uh, a sawmnga uh, a sawm uhte, le uliente-in ka pangsah a, na minam zosie sung vuah makai vaihawm dingin ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Khum hun lai-in na thukhen vaihawmte uh tam bangin thu ka hil hi: “Na unaute uh kikala kihehnate za unlen a dih lamin khenpiehin mite khatlekhat kikal ahi a, tuolsung mi le pemtate kikalah ahi zongin dihtahin thu khen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu khenna-ah guptuom paituom na nei sih ding uhi: Mi a neu a lien ci loin a kibangin a thu ngaipieh un; thukhenna pen Pasien-a’ ahi bo ziehin koima na giing sih ding uhi. Thu khatpo hamsa na sah luot uleh ka kungah hing tut un, keima’n ka khen ding hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum hunin na bawl ding zosie uh kang hil zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa i Pasien ei thupiehsa bang lienin Horeb panin i dingkhie vua, Kadesh-barnea i tun masangsie-un, Amor-te’ muoltung gam zotna lamkala na musa uh a gol a zauhuoi senel gam zosie i nawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in na kung vuah, “ Topa i Pasien ei pieh Amor-te’ muoltung gam na tung zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />En un, Topa na Pasien un note tungah tua leitang ang pie zo hi; peito unlen, Topa na pu na pate uh’ Pasien in ang kamciemsa bangin va luo ta un; zau sih unlen lungkie sih un,” kang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na unpi-un keima kungah nang pei vua, “Eite dinga gam van dingin i masang vuah mi sawl masa vai-in, i peito nading lampi le i zot ding khuopite tawh kisai-in eite kungah thu hing tutkia uheh,’ nei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Keima in zong tua bang gelna pen hoi tuoh ka sa a, minam khatah khat, note lah panin mi sawm le ni ka teel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate dingkhie-in muoltung gamah a pei to vua, tuale Eshcol kuomah pei-in a va dap-et ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua leitanga pieng singga pawlkhat i kungah ang tawisuh uhi. Amate in i kung vuah thu ang tutkia vua, “ Topa i Pasien in ei pieh ding gam pen leitang hoi ahi hi,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin na peito nuom sih uhi. Note in Topa na Pasien uh’ thupiehte na langpang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />na puonbuh sung vuah na tawngphun vua, “ Topa in eite ei muda ziehin Amor-te khut sungah ei pie-in suhmaimang dinga Egypt gam pana ei peipi ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hei lam manaw-a pei ding i hi uh ahei? I sanggamte thugen in ei lung kiesah a, “Eite sangin khum gam mite a golzaw vua, zong a sangzaw uhi; khuopite gol a, van holin kulpi tawh ki-im hi! Khum munah Anak’ suonte ka mu tahtah uhi!’ na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Keima in na kung vuah, “Amate zatah sih unlen zong giing beh sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na masang vua a pei Topa na Pasien un Egypt gam sungah na mitmu mama-un a bawl bangin ama in note dingin gal ang simpieh ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />mi khat in a tapa a puoh bangin tam mun nang tun masangsie-un, Topa na Pasien un na khuolzinna uh lam tungtawn senel gamah ang bangci puoh ahei ci na musa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam bang thu om hi napi, na Topa na Pasien uh na muong sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in na giephuol sat nading uh mun ang suipieh ding le na pei nading uh lampi ang lah dingin na mai vuah zanin mei, sunin meii-in a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in na thugente uh a zah ciengin lungthahin tam bangin kiciem hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Na pu na pate uh tungah pieh dinga ka kamciemsa gam hoi pen Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb lobuong tami khang gilote lahah koima khat beh in a mu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in a lungsim zosie tawh Topa a zui ziehin ama le a suonlehlahte tungah a totsa leitang ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Note ziehin kei tung nangawnah zong Topa lungthah a, “Nang zong khum gam na lut sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khum munah na kithuopi pa Nun’ tapa Joshua a lut ding hi; ama hantawh in, azieh pen ama Israel-te khum gam luosah ding pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khum gamah galte mat bep ding hi bo na ci uh na nausente ule tu laitaha a sie le a pha a khen thei nai lo na tate uh a lut ding hi; keima in tua gam pie-in amate in tua gam a luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin note na hi leh, San Tuipi lam manaw-in senel gamah kilekia un,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Note in nei dawngkia vua, “ Topa tungah ka maw zo ta uhi! Topa i Pasien in eite ei thupieh bang lienin peito-in galdo dingin a kigingsa-in ka om uhi,” nei ci uhi. Tuaci’n na milipun na galvante uh tawi-in na kawng uh na gah ciet vua, muoltung kato ding na bai ngaisut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />” Topa in keima kungah, ‘Amahaw kungah gen inlen, ‘Na lah vuah kei om lo ka hi ziehin kuonto da mai unlen gal zong va do da lel un. Na do pau uleh na galte un ang zo ding hi, ci-in,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na kung vua kang gen vangin note in nei mang nuom sih uhi. Topa’ thupiehna na langpan vua, muoltung gamah na peito paupau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ang sim dingin muoltung gama na teng ahi Amor-te ang kuon vua, Seir gam Hormah dongah khuoi bangin hing delin ang zogawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Note na kilekia vua, Topa mai-a na kaa ciengun, Topa in na aw uh ang thupisim sih a, zong ang thudon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nidanga bangin Kadesh ah ni tampi na thaam zaw ciengun,
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in keima ei gensa bangin San Tuipi lam manaw-in senel gam i zinkia vua, Seir Muol kimvelah ni tampitah i vahvai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah tam bangin ei gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tam muol kimah sauvei khop na vahthap zo ta uhi. Leilu lam naw ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite tam bangin thu pie in: Sier gama a teng na sanggamte ule Esau’ suon le hlahte’ gam sung a nawh ding na hi uhi. Amate in ang giing ding uhi, tua ahi ziehin kidawm mama unlen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate tawh kido sih un. Bangzieh ahei cile a luo dingin Esau tungah Seir Muol pie zo ka hi ziehin na ketot cie nangawn uzong amau’ leitang kang pie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate tung panin na neh ding uh an sum tawh na lei ding uhi; amate tung panin na dawn ding uh tui zong sum ma tawh na lei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na sepna zosie vuah Topa na Pasien un thupha ang pie valon ding hi; ama in tam senel gam lienpi na peina uh ang thei hi. Tam kum sawmli sungin note tawh Topa na Pasien uh ang omton hi; bangma na kisam sih uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n Seir gama a teng i sanggam Esau’ tate i pelh vua, Arabah lampi, Elath lampi le Ezion-geber lampi lam i zui nawn sih uhi. Moab senel gam lampi dung teng manaw-in i pei ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in ka kungah tam bang ei ci hi: “Moab-te gimsah sih unlen, amate tawh galin kido sih un. Bangzieh ahei cile Lot’ suon le hlahte nei dingin Ar khuo pie zo ka hi ziehin, na nei dingun amau’ leitang behkhat zong kang pie sih ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(Anak-te banga a tun sang, a tam le a lien Emim-te khum munah nidangin teng ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate pen Moab-te in Emim-te a ci vangun Anak-te ma bangin amate zong Rephaim-te in kingaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua tham loin Seir gamah Hor-te a na teng ngai vua, ahi vangin Topa in amau’ nei dinga a pieh leitangah Israel-te in a na bawl bangin, Esau’ suon le hlahte in zong amate na suonin na susie a, amau’ tenna mun na luo uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tua ciengin Zered Lui kantan un,” ei ci hi. Tuaci’n eite in Zered Lui i kantan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate tawh kisai-in Topa a kiciemsa bangin giephuol panin galhang khangmite zosie a si sieng dong ahi, Kadesh-barnea panin Zered Lui i kantan dong kikal kum sawmthum le kum giet sung khuol i zin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un giephuol panin a si sieng dongun a langkhat vuah Topa’ khut a pang tahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihingte lah panin galhang zosie a si zaw ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in ka kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tuni-in Ar khuo-a Moab gamgi a kantan ding na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor-te’ gamgi na neh ciengun amate phin sih unlen galin zong kido sih un, azieh pen na nei dingun na tung vuah Ammon-te’ gam kang pie sih ding hi. Bang ding ahei cile Israel-te tungah tua leitang ka pie zo hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Khum gam pen Rephaim gam zong na kici ngai hi. Khumi munah Rephaim-te na teng ngai vua, ahi vangin amate pen Ammon-te in Zamzummim-te ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anak-te banga a tun sang, a thahat le a citam mite ahi uhi. Hinanle Ammon-te in amate suonin amau’ munah a ten thei nadingun Topa in Ammon-te mai-ah amate a susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in Sier-a a teng Esau’ suonlehlahte adingin amate mai-ah Hor-te a suhsiet ma bangin amate in zong tua mite susie-in gam nei lo a suo vua, tuni dongin amau’ gam a luo suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Caphtor pana ang pei ahi Caphtor-te in Gaza tawh a kinai-a na tengsa Avvim-te susie-in amau’ munah teng uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na khuolzin maban zom unlen Arnon Lui kansan un. En un, na khut sung vuah Heshbon Kumpipa, Amor-te Sihon le ama’ leitang kang pie zo hi. Ama suon dingin kipan unlen ama va sim ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuni-in vansin nei-a om mite in ang zatah nading ule ang giin nadingun ka bawl ding a, amate in na thu a zah ciengun citunin note ziehin a lung gim ding uhi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in Kedemoth senel gam panin Heshbon kumpipa Sihon kungah kamtai sawlin tam bang kilemna ding thu ka puohsah hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Na gam sung nei nawsah leh lampi behah ka pei ding vua, ziet le vei-ah ka piel sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka neh ding uh an sum tawh lei dingin nei zua ding a, ka dawn ding uh tui sum ma tawh lei dingin nei pie ding hi. Ka keng utawh ei nawhsah maimai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jordan kantanin Topa ka Pasien un ei pieh gam ka tun masangin Seir-a teng Esau’ suonte le Ar-a teng Moab-te in ei peisah bang lienin ei peisah in,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Heshbon kumpipa Sihon in ei peisah lo hi. Azieh pen Topa na Pasien un tuni-a a bawl bangin na khut sung vuah ama a pieh thei nadingin a lungsim a khausah a, a lung zong a phengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah, “En in, na tungah Sihon le a leitang pieh kang kipan zo ta hi. A leitang na luo nadingin tu-in a lah kipan in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaci’n eite do dingin Jahaz ah Sihon le a mite zosie ang kuon ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa i Pasien in eite tungah ama ei pie hi; eite in a tapate le a mite zosie tawh ama i that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khum hunin ama’ khuopi zosie i la vua, khuopi sima pasal, numei, le naupangte i su maimang uhi. A suohta khat beh i nuasie sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I lahsa uh khuopi sunga van kinuasie teng tawh eima’ kep dingin ganhonte beh i la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Arnon Lui monga (tua lui-a om khuopi zong kihal hi) om Aroer panin Gilead dongin eite adingin khuopi kul a sang seng khat beh a om sih a, Topa i Pasien in a unpi-in i khut sung vuah ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ammon-te’ leitang na neh sih vua, Topa i Pasien’ ei thuhil bang lienin Jabbok Lui a tunglam gam buppi le muol tunga om khuopite zong na pel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bashan peina lam manaw-in i peito ciengun eite ei do dingin Endrei ah Bashan Kumpipa Og le a mite zosie ang kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah, “Ama giing sin, azieh pen ama le a mite le a leitang tawh nang tungah kang pie zo hi. Heshbon a uh Amor kumpipa Sihon tunga na bawl bangin ama tungah zong bawl in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa i Pasien in Bashan kumpipa Og le a mite zosie zong eite tungah ei pie hi. Amate a suohta khat zong om lo za dongin i satlia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum hunin eite in a khuopi zosie uh i la uhi; Bashan gam sunga om Og kumpi gam, Argob gambup, le khuopi sawmguhte i la vua, amate tung pan i lah lo uh khuopi khat zong a om sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />khuota tampite simlo, ta khuopite zosie a unpi-in kul sangpite, kotpite le kotgolh zawlpite tawh thuop ni-a kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Heshbon-a Sihon kumpipa i bawl bangun a khuopi sung ciet vua pasalte, numeite, le naupangte zosie i sumaimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin a ganhon zosie ule khuopi sunga gal vanlah zosie eima’ dingin i la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum hunin Jordan galkhata om Amor kumpi nite tung panin Arnon Lui pan Hermon Muol dong
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Sidon-te in Hermon pen Sirion ci-in Amor-te in Senir ci uhi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />muoltung zanggam khuopite zosie, Gilead gambuppi le Bashan gam zosie, Salecah le Edrei cieng dong, Bashan-a om Og kumpipa gam khuopite i la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(Tu-in Rephaim-te lahah a omlai Bashan kumpipa Og beh ahi hi. Ama’ lupna pen sia tawh kibawl ahi a, tua pen Ammon-te’ khuopi Rabbah ah kimu thei lai hi. Tongtena ngaina tawh a kite ciengin a sauna tong kuo ahi a, a vailam tong li ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum hun lai-a i lah uh leitang tawh kisai ahile, Reuben-te le Gad-te tungah keima in Arnon Lui monga om Aroer sahlam gam, Gilead muoltung gam alang le a khuopite tawh zong ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in Gilead gama a omlai teng le Og’ kumpi gam ahi Bashan gam zosie, Manasseh minam alangte tungah ka pie hi. (Argob gam buppi ahi Bashan gam zosie pen Rephaim leitang kici hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh mi Jair in Bashan kici Agrob gam zosie, Geshur-te le Maacath-te’ gamgi cieng dong la a, tua khuote ama’ min tapsah a, tuni dongin Havvoth-jair kici lai hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in Gilead gam pen Machir tungah ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in Gilead panin Arnon Lui cieng dong, a laikima lui pen gamgi hisahin, Ammon-te’ gamgi lui ahi Jabbok cieng dong tawh Reuben-te le Gad-te tungah ka pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />keima in Arabah gam zong, Jordan gun le a gungeite tawh, Chinnereth panin Tuipi Si ahi Arabah tuipi cieng dong, nisuona lama om Pisgah muolpang kensuh teng tawh amate ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum hunin tam bangin thu kang pie hi: “ Topa i Pasien in na luo dingun tam leitang ang pieh vangin a madawh dingin na galkapte zosie galvan tawh kivonin na sanggam Israel-te mai-ah galkai masa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na zite, na tate, le na ganhonte (ganhon tampi tah na nei lam uh ka thei hi) ahile note kang piehsa khuopite-ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />No tunga ang pieh bangin Topa in na sanggamte uh tungah zong tawlngahna ang pieh ciengin, amate in zong Topa na Pasien un Jordan galkhata ang pieh ding leitang a luo vua, tua ciengin keima in na tung vua kang piehsa gam cietah na unpi-un na pei thei ding uhi,” kang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum hunin keima in Joshua zong tam bangin thu ka pie hi: “ Topa na Pasien in tam kumpi nite tunga a bawlsa zosie na mitin na mu zo hi. Tuaci’n na nawh lai ding kumpi gam zosie tungah zong Topa in tua ma bangin ang bawl ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate giing sin. Azieh pen nang adinga ang dopieh pa khu Topa na Pasien ahi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima in khum hunin zong Topa kungah tam bangin ka thum hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ Topa Pasien aw, na nasempa tungah na lietna le na hatnate ang lah pan na hi na bo hi; vantungah ahi a, leitungah ahi zongin tua bang nasepte le sil thupite nangma bawl banga a bawl thei bang pasien om ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jordan gala a om tua muoltung gam hoi le Lebanon mu dingin ei galkaisah ta’n,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanle note ziehin kei tungah Topa lungthah a, ka thumna a sang sih hi. Topa in keima kungah, ‘Phazo ta! Tam thu ka kungah hing genkia nawn sin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pisgah dawnah kato inlen, na kimvela nitumna lam, leilu lam, leitaw lam, le nisuona lam gal et in. Hoitahin en in. Azieh pen tam Jordan gun na galkai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin Joshua thu pie inlen, ama hantawhin thakhausah in. Bangzieh ahei cile tam mite mai-ah ama pei-in galkai ding a, nangma in na mu ding leitang amate luosah ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n Beth-peor tawh kigalsai kuom sungah i om uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te aw, tu-in note nungta-in, Topa na pu na pate uh’ Pasien in note ang pieh ding leitangah lutin na luo thei nadingun kang hil thukhamte le ngaina kipte mang unlen zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kang thupiehte belap loin zong ladawh sih unlen, kang thupieh ahi Topa na Pasien uh’ thukhamte na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Peor-a Baal tawh kisai-in Topa’ silbawlte le Peor-a Baal nuazuite zosie Topa na Pasien un bangci suhsiet ci thu note in na mit-un na mu zo ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na Topa Pasien uh a tukip note zosie tuni-in na hing lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />En un, Topa ka Pasien in kei ei thupieh bang lienin lutin na lah ding uh gam sungah na zui ding uh thukhamte le ngaina kipte kang hil zo ta hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Limtahin tuate zui un, azieh pen tami in mite tungah na pilna ule na thu khinkhai theina uh ang talang ding a, amate in tam thukham zosie a zah ciengun, “A tahtahin tam minam liente pen a pil le thu khinkhai thei mite hi bo vuoi!,” ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Topa i Pasien uh i ko sielun i kung vuah i Pasien ang nai op za-in tua bang Pasien a nei adang minam lien hei-ah om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuni-in na mai vua kang koipieh thukham bucing bangin a dih thukham le ngaina kip a nei minam lien adang hei-ah om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin na mit un a musa nate na khantanun mangngil kha-in na lungsim panun a peidawh lo nadingin limtahin ngaisunin kikemcing un; na tate ule na tute uzong theisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Horeb ah na Topa Pasien uh mai-ah na din lai-un, Topa in keima kungah, “Leitunga a nuntah laisie-un ei giing a, a tate a hilsawn thei nadingun amate tungah ka thute ka zahsah thei nadingin keima kungah mite hing khawm in,” ei cina thu na tate ule na tute tungah theisah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Muolpi mei in ka-in van tungah meikhu kitung valuh a, meiivom in a tuom laitahin muol zungah na ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin mei sung panin Topa in note hing hopi a, a thugente na za vua, hizongle a meel mu loin a aw beh na za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in note zui dingin na kung vuah ama’ thuciemna ahi, thupieh sawmte ang gen hi; ama in suongpeh ni tungah tuate giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note galkai-in tua gam na luo cieng vua na zui ding uh thukhamte le ngaina kipte hil dingin khum hunin Topa in keima thu ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Horeb ah mei sung panin Topa in na kung vuah thu ang gen lai-in a meel na mu lo ziehun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />lim khatpopo, pasal tawh kisun ahi a, numei tawh kisun ahi zongin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />leitunga om ganhing khatpo ahi a, hui lahah a leng hla a nei va khatpo tawh kisun ahi zongin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />leitunga a bawhva khatpo tawh kisun ahi a, leinei tui sunga om ngasa khatpo tawh kisun ahi zongin, noma’ adingin milim khengtawmin na siet gamtat khah lo nadingun kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Van lamah dahto-in Topa na Pasien un muncin tengah vannuoi mite dinga a piehsa ni, hla le aasite, le vantung na zosie na etto ciengun tua nate lamah kihei-in a mai vuah kunin, amau’ na na sep khah lo nadingun kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-a na omdan bang vua ama’ mi na hi thei nadingun Topa in sia meikhuh tawh a kibang Egypt panin hing la-in ang peipi zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note ziehin keima tungah Topa lungthah a, Jordan gun ka galkai lo nading le, na luo ding vua ang pieh gamhoi sungah ka lut lo nadingin Topa na Pasien uh a kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Jordan gun galkai loin tam leitangah ka si ding a, ahi vangin note galkai-in tua gamhoi na luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa na Pasien un note tawh a bawl thuciemna mangngilin, Topa na Pasien un bawl vawt lo dinga ang kham lim khatpopo tawh kibangin a kikheng milim noma dinga na bawlkhah lo nadingun kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa na Pasien uh khu mi katum thei meikuong tawh kibang a, a thangsie Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note in tu le ta nei zo-in no le no khum gamah ngaimuongin na op zaw ciengun, na khatpopo tawh kisunin a kikhengtawm milim na bawlna ule, Topa na Pasien uh’ mitmu-in sil hoi lo na bawlna ziehun ama na lungthahsah uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jordan gun galkai-in na luo ding uh gam panin na manthai sieng nadingun na langkhat vuah teci a pang dingin keima in vanpi le leipi ka ko hi; tua gamah note sawtvei teng loin ang kisusie cip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in mite lahah note ang thethang ding a, Topa in ang pui nading minamte lahah a citawmno khat behin na om ta bo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khum munah mite’ khut tawh a kibawl, khuomu thei lo, khuo za thei lo, a ne thei lo, gimnam a za thei lo singlesuong pasien-te’ na na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khum mun panin note in Topa na Pasien uh na sui ding vua, na lungsim zosie ule na hinna zosie utawh na sui uleh ama na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Genthei thuohin mailam hun ciengin na tung vuah tam thute zosie ang tun ciengin, Topa na Pasien uh lamah kihei-in a thu na mang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh khu a hepi thei Pasien ahi ziehin hing nuasie loin hing susie lo ding a, ama in na pu na pate utawh a thuciemna a mangngil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azieh pen tu-in Pasien in leitung ah mihing a piensah ni-a kipanin note’ pien masang a tawpsa hun le nite kan unlen, van mongkhat pan mongkhat donga thute zong kan un. Tam bang sil thupite pieng ngai-in, a kiza ngai ta mawng amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Note in mei sung panin Pasien’ aw za-in na hin lai bangun a hing lai koi minam om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi sihle Topa na Pasien un na mitmu-un Egypt gamah note dinga a bawl ma bangin zelahna, lim le na lamdangte, gal le sa, a vanglien le a thahatna le a zauhuoi mama tawh pasien dangkhat popo in minam dang khat panin minam khat ama’ mite hisah dingin va la-in peipi dingin a hanciem ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa pen Pasien ahi hi, ci-a na thei nadingun na tung vuah tam thu ang kilah ahi a, ama simlo koima dang a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Note ang khal thei nadingin vantung panin a aw ang zasah hi. Mei sung panin ama’ kammal na zah laitahun, ama in leitungah note mei thupitah ang musah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in na pu na pate uh a it ziehin a nua sang vua a suonlehlahte hing teelin amama in Egypt panin vanglietna tawh note ang peipi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />na mai vuah no sanga nam thupizaw le a hatzaw mite delmangin tuni banga na ten thei nadingun a gam sung vuah ang peipi a, na luo dingun a leitang uh ang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa pen vantung le leitungah Pasien ahi hi, ci-in tuni-in thei unlen, na lungsim sung vuah vom un; koima dang a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Noma mama le noma’ nua-a na suon na hlahte uh’ hoi nading le Topa na Pasien un kumtawn dinga ang pieh gam sungah kumsawt na hin thei nadingun keima in na kung vuah tuni-a kang gen a thukhamte le a thupiehte zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Jordan nisuona lamah khuopi thum a khenkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A tawpsa hunin kigalbawlna om lo napi, sawm lopi-in midang khat a that kha pa tua munah tai thei ding hi; khuopi khat popo-ah tua mithat pa tai-in nungta ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Reuben-te dingin senel gam muolzanga Beza khuo, Gad-te dingin Gilead gam sunga Ramoth khuo, le Manasseh-te dingin Bashan gam sunga Golan khuote ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te mai-a a na koi thukham khu tami ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tami ngainate, thukipte, le thukhamte pen Egypt pan Israel-te a peikhiet ciengun Moses in hopi-in a gen thute ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Egypt pan a peikhiet ciengun Moses le Israel-te in a na zaw gawp uh ahi Heshbon-a kumpi a sem Amor-te’ kumpipa Sihon gam sung, Jordan gungal lam Beth-peor tawh a kigalsai kuom sunga a op laitah vua a gen thute ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amate in Bashan kumpi Og gam Jordan nisuona lama om Amor-te’ kumpi nite gam a lahpieh uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Arnon Lui monga om Aroer panin Sirion Muol dong (khum pen Hermon kici) kihlungsuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jordan nisuona lam Arabah gam zosie huomin Pisgah muolken nei-a om Arabah Tuipi dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te zosie hlan a, amate tungah tam bangin a gen hi: Israel-te aw, tuni-in keima in na kung vua kang gen ding thukhamte le ngaina kipte za un; tuate sinin limtahin na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa i Pasien in Horeb ah eite tawh thuciemna khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in i pu i pate tawh tam thuciemna a bawl hi loin tuni-a a hinglai eite zosie tawh zong a bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in muol tung mei sung panin note tawh kimaituo-in ang hopi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(Khum hunin note tungah Topa’ thute phuongzah dingin Topa le na kikal vuah keima ka ding hi! Azieh pen note in meikuong na giing vua, muoltungah na kato ngam sih uhi.) Ama in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima pen saltanna Egypt leitang pana note ang peipito Topa na Pasien uh ka hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />note in keima mai-ah pasien dang na nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tunga vantung ahiei, nei-a leitung ahiei, ahi sihle leinei-a om tui sung ahiei-a a om na khatpopo tawh a kisun milim khat popo noma dingin na bawl sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuate mai-ah kun loin zong na bie sih ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile keima Topa na Pasien uh pen a thangsie Pasien ka hi a, keima ei niel mite tungah a pate’ mawna a tate tungah khang thum khang lina dongin ka thuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahi vangin keima ei itin ka thupiehna a zui mite tungah a khang tul khatna dongin itna kip ka lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ min a sie lamin na zang sih ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa in a sie lamin ama’ min a zang mite maw lo hi, ci lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un note ang thupieh bangin sabbath ni a siengtho-in tang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nasep ding zosie uh ni guh sungin na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin a ni sagi ni pen Topa na Pasien uh’ sabbath ni ahi hi; nangma, na tapa na tanu, na sila pa le na sila nu, na bawngtang, na laa, na ganhonte khat popo le na khuopi sunga om pemtate tawlnga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt gamah sila na hina ule tua mun panin Topa na Pasien un a thahat khut le a kizah ban tawh ang peipina na phawh ding uhi; tua ahi ziehin sabbath ni na tan nading uh Topa na Pasien un thu ang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un note ang pieh ding leitang tungah khan kum sawtin na nopsah thei nadingun Topa na Pasien uh’ ang thupieh bangin na nu le na pa zatah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuol na that sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ang na kawm sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na gu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na vengpa lang khatah zuouthu teci na pang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na vengpa’ zi na deigaw sih ding uhi. Na vengpa’ a inn, a lo, a na sempa, a nasemnu, a bawngtang, a laa, ahi sihle na vengpa’ na khat popo na deigaw sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in tam thu teng pen mei kuong, meei, le mielking lah panin muoltunga kikhawm note zosie tungah awging lienpi tawh ang gen ahi a, ama in adang a genbe tuon sih hi. Ama in suongpeh ni tungah tuate gielin keima tungah ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mei in muol a kah laitahin khuomiel sung panin awging na zah ciengun keima kungah na minam lutang zosie le na upate ang pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Note in, “En vawi, Topa i Pasien in eite tungah a vanglietna le a thupina ei lah zo a, mei sung panin a awging i za zo hi. Pasien in mi hopi napi mite hinglai veve a, tuni-in i mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n bang ziehin eite tu-in si ding i hi uh ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile tua meikuong gimnei-in ei katum ding hi; i Topa Pasien’ awging i zahkia lai uleh a si ding i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite’ zah bangin meikuong sung panin Pasien’ aw za-a a hinglai koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang mama a kungah va pei inlen, Topa i Pasien’ gen ding zosie va za tan. Tua ciengin ka kung vuah Topa Pasien’ ang gen zosie hing gen inlen, tuaci’n kote in zong mangin ka sem ding uhi,” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei nei hopi ciengun Topa in na thugen uh na za a, tuale Topa in keima kungah tam bangin ang gen hi: “Tam mite in na kunga ang thugen uh ka za zo hi; a gen zosie uh a manin a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate le a suonlehlahte uh a nopsah tawntung thei nadingun keima ei giingin ka thupieh zosie zui den nopna tam bang lungsim puo den tave ule izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pei inlen a kung vuah, ‘Na puonbuh sung vuah kilekia ta un,’ va ci tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hizongle tam mun keima kungah ding inlen, amate luo dinga ka pieh leitangah a ten ciengun a zui ding vua na hilsawn ding thupieh zosie, thukham zosie le ngaina kip zosie na kungah kang gen ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa na Pasien un ang thupiehsa banga na gamtat nadingun kidawm un; zietlam ahiei veilam ahiei-ah na piel sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na luo ding uh gamah nungta-in, nuomsa-in kumsawt na hin thei nadingun Topa na Pasien un ang thupiehsa lampi bang lienin na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in tam teng pen note galkai-in na luo ding uh gamah na tun ciengun na zui ding vua Topa na Pasien un note tungah kang hil dinga ei thupieh, thukhamte le ngaina kipte ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaci’n na hinkhuo uh a sawt thei nadingin note, na tate ule na tute un na hin sung tungtawnun Topa na Pasien uh zatahin, kei ei hil sawnsah a thukhamte le a thupieh zosie na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel aw, na nopsah thei nading le na pu na pate uh’ Pasien Topa nangma tunga ang ciemsa bangin, note zong bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna gamah na pun na men thei nadingun tam thute ngai unlen limtahin zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel-te aw, za un: Topa i Pasien pen Topa khat beh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh, na lungtang zosie, na hinna zosie le na hatna zosie utawh na it ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in tuni-a note kang pieh tam thute na lungtang vuah vom lenlon un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na tate hil unlen, inn ah na op uh cieng, khuolai na va uh cieng, na lup uh cieng le na thaw uh ciengin amate genpi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khut tung vuah lim dingin tuate khi unlen, na zangpai vuah melcina-in tuate suong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kotbieng khuomte tung le na tunkotte tung vuah tuate giel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na pu na pate uh ahi Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob-te tungah pieh dinga a na ciemsa gam, na lam lo uh a gol a hoi khuopite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na khol lo uh sil hoi tawh kidim innte, na taw lo uh tuikhuhte, na suon lo uh lengga guite, le olive kungte opna gamah hing peipi-in khamtahin na neh zaw ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />saltanna Egypt gam panin note ang peipi Topa na mangngil khah lo nading uh kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh na zatah ding uhi; ama’ na beh na sem ding vua, ama’ min beh tawh na kiciem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kimvel vua mite’ pasien-te ahi pasien dangte na zui sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen note tawh ang omton Topa na Pasien uh pen a thangsie Pasien ahi hi. Na langkhat vuah Topa na Pasien uh’ lungthahna hing kikuontaw ding a, tuaci’n lei maitang panin note ang susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Massah munah ama na zelah bangun Topa na Pasien uh na zelah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un note ang thupiehte, a thukipte, a thukhamte limtahin na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in na pu na pate uh tunga pieh dinga a ciemsa leitang hoi-ah lutin na luo thei nading ule na nopsah thei nadingun Topa muna-ah a man le a hoi nate bawl unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa ang kamciem bangin na mai panun na galte zosie uh notmang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ang tung ding hunah na tapate un, “ Topa i Pasien in note ang thupieh ahi thukipte, thukhamte le ngaina kipte bang a cinopna ahei?” ci-in ang dawh ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />na tapate uh kungah, “Egypt gamah Pharaoh’ salin i na om vua, ahi vangin Egypt panin Topa in a banhat tawh ei na peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in i muna vuah Egypt, Pharaoh le a innkuonpite zosie tungah a lien le a cizathuoi lim le na lamdangte ei na lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I pu i pate tungah pieh dinga a na ciemsa leitangah ei puoh dingin khum mun panin ei na peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin i hoi zing nading ule tuni-a banga ei hinsuo thei nadingin, Topa i Pasien zatatin tami thukham zosie i zui nadingin Topa in thu ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ei thupiehsa bangin Topa i Pasien uh muna ah tam thupieh vannuoi limtahin i zui uleh, thuman sungah i om ding uhi,” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na luo ding uh gamah hing puohin na lut ciengun, na mai vuah no sanga a thahatzaw le a tamzaw minam sagite ahi Hit-te, Girgash-te, Amor-te, Canaan-te, Perez-te, Hiv-te, le Jebus-te delmangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un nohaw tungah amate hing pie-in, amahaw na zaw zo ciengun, a unpi-in na susiemang ding uhi. Amate tawh thuciemna bawl sih unlen a tung vuah hepina zong lah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate tawh zi le ta-in kizong sih unlen, a tapate uh tungah na tanute pie loin, na tapate uh adingin zong a tanute uh la sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen pasien dangte’ na sem dingin keima ei zuina panun na tate uh a pielsah ding uhi. Tua ciengin note tungah Topa’ lungthahna kikuontaw ding a, tuaci’n thakhatin note ang susie ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanle amate tungah tam bangin na bawl ding uhi: Amau’ maitamte susie-in amau’ khuom siengthote satcim unlen, amau’ khuom siengthote phua-in, amau’ milimte mei tawh hal un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa na Pasien uh tungah note a siengtho mi na hi uhi; Topa na Pasien un leitung mi zosie lah panin ama’ mi ding le ama’ gougil nei dingin note ang teel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midangte sanga na tamzawh zieh vua note tungah Topa hing lunglutin ang teel na hi sih uhi. Bang ding ahei cile mi namcinte lahah note a citawm pen na hi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in na saltanna uh Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh’ khut sung pan ang hutkhiet a, a vanglietna tawh ang peipina pen Topa in note hing itin na pu na pate uh kunga a kiciemna a zuina zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa na Pasien un Pasien ahi a, ama itin ama’ thupiehna a zui mite tungah khang tul tampi dongin a thuciemna le a itna a tukip a thuman Pasien a hina thu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ama a niel mite tungah suhsietna tawh a thuh pa a hina thu thei un. Ama a niel mite tungah kiheh loin ama in susietna tawh a thuh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tuni-in na kung vua kang gen thupiehte, thukhamte, le ngaina kipte limtahin zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note in tami ngaina kipte kukal tahin na zui uleh note tungah Topa na Pasien un na pu na pate uh tunga a na ciemsa thuciemna’ thumanna khu a tukip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in note hing itin, thupha hing pie-in, ang pungsah ding hi; na sung vua piengte, na leitang pan vua a piengte, na an ule na lenggazu uh, na sathaute ule na ganhonte uh hing pungsahin, na tuuhonte ule na keelno honte uzong thupha ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi zosie lahah thupha nga pen minam na hi ding vua, noma lahah ahi a, na ganhonte lah vuah ahi zongin ta nei lo a ciing a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note sung panin Topa in natna vannuoi hemkhie ding hi; note tungah Egypt gam’ natna huoisie zosie ang tung sih ding hi, ahi vangin ama in ang muda mite tungah tuate a tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na tung vua ang pieh minam zosie a unpi-in na susie ding vua, amate na khuotuo sih ding uhi; note dingin amate pen thang anta ang hi ding uh ahi ziehin a pasien-te na bie sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungsim sung vuah, “Eite sangin tam minamte a tamzaw uhi; amate bang i ci suon zo ding uh ahei? na ci khah uleh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />giing malmal sih un. Topa na Pasien un Pharaoh le Egypt-te zosie tunga a bawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na mit utawh na mu uh zelahna lienpite, lim le na lamdangte, khut thahat le a kizah bante tawh ang peipi Topa na Pasien uh phawh un. Topa na Pasien un na giin uh mi zosie tungah tua bang lienin a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua tham loin, Topa na Pasien un a omlaite le a kiphuolte a kisuhsiet sieng masangsie, amate lahah gimna a tungsah ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Noma tawh ang omton Topa na Pasien uh pen a lien le a giinhuoi Pasien ahi ziehin amate giing sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na masang vuah tam minamte themthemin notmang ding hi; note in thakhatin na notmang thei sih ding uhi. Tua hi mawh leh note dingin gamsate ang tam seng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle Topa na Pasien un na tung vuah amate ang pie ding a, amahaw a kisuhsiet masangin kipatausah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in na khut sung vuah a kumpite uh ang pie ding a, note in vansin nei panin amau’ min na phietmang ding uhi; amate na suhsiet zo masangsie-un na langkhat vuah koima pang zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate pasien-te’ limte mei tawh na hal ding uhi. Tua thangah awh thei ding na hi ziehun tuate tunga om ngunte ahi a, khamte ahi zongin deigaw sih unlen noma dingin zong la sih un; bangzieh ahei cile tua khu Topa na Pasien uh adingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na inn sung vuah a kidahhuoi nate tumpi sih un. Tua hile tuate bangin suhsiet dinga kituomkoite na suoh ding uhi. Tua nate kidahin na huot mama ding uh ahi hi, azieh pen tua nate suhsiet dinga kituomkoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note nungta-in na pun nading ule na pu na pate uh tungah Topa in a ciemsa gamah pei-in na luo thei nadingun tuni-in note kang pieh tami thupiehte zosie kukal taha na zui nadingun thu kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note ang suhnem thei nading, a thupiehte na zui vuoi mah, na zui sih vuoi ci-a a thei nading le na lungtang vuah bang om ahei ci-in a thei nadingin amate in note ang zelahna-in Topa na Pasien un tam kum sawmli sung senel gamah lam saupi tah ang puina khu phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihingte pen an beh tawh nungta ahi sih a, Topa’ kam sung pana a pusuoh thu zosie tawh nungta hizaw hi, ci-in ang theisah nadingin note hing gilkielsahin hing sunem a, tua ciengin no na hi vua, na pu na pate ahi zongin na thei ngai nai lo uh manna tawh ang va hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami kum sawmli sungin na el vua na puonsil uh sie loin na keng uzong pawm vawt lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n nu le pate in a tapa a khal bangin Topa na Pasien un no ang khalna thu na lungtang vuah thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama’ lampi zuina le ama zatahna tawh Topa na Pasien uh’ thupiehte zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa na Pasien un muol le guoma a luong luite opna, ciatui le tuisamte a luonna leitang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mangbu le mangbuham, lenggui le theikung, mang kawlsing opna leitang, olive kungte le khuoizu luonna leitang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />an cilbawl loin kitasap bangma om lo-a an na neh theina uh leitang, a suongtumte sia hi a, a muoltangte panin sumsan na taw theina uh leitang ahi gam hoi-ah note ang peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gilva tahin an na ne ding vua, gam hoi ang pieh ziehin Topa na Pasien uh na phat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni-in keima in na tung vua kang gen a thupiehte, a ngaina kipte le a thukhamte na zui lona utawh Topa na Pasien uh na mangngil khah lo nading uh kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gilva tahin na neh zaw uh cieng, inn hoite lamin tuate sungah na ten uh cieng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na ganhonte ule na tuuhonte uh a pun cieng le na khamte ule na ngunte uh ang tam a, na nei na lam zosiete uzong ang kiningcin ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />no le no kiliensah pai sih unlen, saltanna Egypt gam pana ang peipi Topa na Pasien mangngilh sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a lien a zauhuoi senel gamah gul guneite, mom-aite lah le tui op lona gamgawta lahah note ang peipi hi. Ama in na dawn dingun meisuong tawh a kibang suongpi panin tui a phulsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Senel gamah na pu na pate un a thei ngai lo uh manna tawh ang va a, a tawpna-ah na hoi nadingun hing niemkhiehin hing ze-et hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />No le no in, “Ka vanglietna le ka khut thahat in tam hauna ei ngasah ahi hi,” ci sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hizongle tuni-a a bawl bangin na pu na pate uh tungah a kiciemna a kipsah thei nadingin Topa na Pasien uh phawh zing un, bangzieh ahei cile hauna ang pie pa ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh mangngilin pasien dangte’ nua zui a, a na uh semin na bieh uleh, na si tahtah ding uhi, ci-in tuni-in limtahin kang hilkhol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note’ masanga Topa suhsiet minamte bangin note zong na kisie ding uhi, azieh pen note in Topa na Pasien uh’ thu na mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te aw ngai un! Note sanga a tamzaw le a thahatzaw minamte, van holh a kulpi kiciengto khuopite a suonkhie dingin Jordan gungal kai-in a pei ding na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mite pen na theisa uh ahi a tunsang a thahat Anak’ suonte ahi uhi. Amate pen “Anak-te langah koi pang zo ding ahei,” a kici na zah ngaisa uh mite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin note’ Topa Pasien pen mi a katum thei meikuong bangin na masang vua a peipa ahi lam tuni-in thei un. Topa in ang kamciemsa bangin amate suon dawhin mallang tahin na suhsiet thei nadingun, ama in na masang vuah amate gal lelsahin a zogawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na mai vuah amate a nawdawh ciengin na lungsim sung vuah, ‘ Topa in tami leitang a luo dinga ei puohna pen ka dihna zieh uh ahi hi,’ ci kha vawt sih un; Topa in na mai vuah amate a nawdawhna khu tam minamte’ gitlona zieh hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na dihna zieh ule na lungsim manna zieh utawh a gam uh a luo ding na hi sih vua, tam minamte’ gitlona ziehin Topa in kiciemna tawh na pu na pate uh Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tunga a na kamciemsa thu a tangtun nadinga Topa na Pasien un na mai vua amate a nawmang ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin na dihna ziehun Topa na Pasien un na luo ding vua tam gam hoi ang pieh ahi lo lam thei un; azieh pen mi lungkhauhpi na hi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Senel gamah Topa na Pasien uh phinin na lungthahsah dante uh phawh unlen mangngil sih un; Egypt gam panin na pei ni vua kipan tam mun na tun dongun Topa na ledo mielmuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Horeb muol nangawn-ah Topa na thangpaisah vua, na tung vuah Topa a lungthah seng ziehin note susie dingin a baisa-in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in note tawh a bawl thuciemna suongpehte sang dingin muol tungah ka kato lai-in, sun sawmli le zan sawmli sung ka thaam hi; an ne lo, tui dawn loin ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Pasien’ khutme tawh kigiel suongpeh ni kei ei pie hi; tuate tungah muol tunga na kikhop ni vua Topa in na kung vuah mei sung pana ang gensa thu zosie om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sun sawmli le zan sawmli a cin zaw-in Topa in tua kiciemna suongpeh ni tegel keima ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah, “Tho inlen tam panin peisuh meng in. Bangzieh ahei cile Egypt pana na zawpi na mite a siet gamtat sieng ta uhi. Ka thupieh lampi panin a kihei zuai ta vua, amate dingin a kisung milim khat a bawl zo ta uhi,” ci-in ang gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua banah Topa in keima kungah, “Tam mite ahile a lungkhauh tahtah mite ahi hi, ci-in ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate susie-in vansin nei pan a min uh ka phietmai thei nadingin keima guoh ei omsah un; tuale amate sangin a thahatzaw le a citamzaw minamin nang kang bawl ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n muolpi a kuon vapuol laitahin kihei-in muol tung panin ka kumsuh hi; kiciemna suongpeh nite ka khut ni tegel sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin noma dingin a kisung bawngno lim khat na bawlna utawh Topa na Pasien uh tungah na maw zo tahpi lam uh ka mu a, tuaci’n Topa in ang thupiehsa lampi panin na kihei zuai ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei zong ka khut gelin tua suongpeh nite ka tawi a, ka khut tegel panin tuolah sepin na muna vuah ka guoicimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin a masa-a ka bawl ngai bangin Topa mai-ah sun sawmli le zan sawmli sung ka khupbawhkia hi; ama tunga na bawl uh na mawna zosie zieh ule ama mai-ah a sie na gamtatnate utawh Topa na lungthahsah ziehun an ne lo tui dawn loin ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note tungah Topa’ lungthahna nasie seng ahi ziehin ama in note ang suhsiet ding ka zau hi. Hizongle Topa in khumi hunin zong ka thu ei ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aaron tungah Topa thangpai mama a, ama susie dingin a baisa-in om a, ahi vangin khumi hun ma-in Aaron tangin zong ka thumpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in note ang mawsah ahi na bawl uh bawngno lim la-in mei tawh haltumin ka sukeh a, leivui a suo dongin ka gawtvui hi; tua a vuite muol pan a luongsuh luidungah ka pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Taberah, Massah, le Kibroth-hattaavah munte-ah zong Topa phinin na lungthahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Kadesh-barnea panin note ang sawl a, “Peito unlen kang piehsa leitang va luo ta un,” ei ci hun lai-in Topa na Pasien uh’ thupieh langpangin ama muong loin, a thu zong na mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in note ang thei zaw a kipan Topa langpangin na ledo ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in note ang suhsiet sawm ciengin sun sawmli le zan sawmli sung Topa mai-ah khupbawh a ka op sung tungtawnin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa kungah thu ka ngen a, “ Topa Pasien aw, na lietna tawh na tatsa, na banhat tawh Egypt pana na peipi na mite susie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na nasem Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob-te phawh in; tam mite’ lungkhauhna, gitlona, le mawnate thulah seng sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua bang hi sih mawh leh nei peipina gama a teng mite in, ‘ Topa in amate a ciemsa leitangah a peipi thei lo zieh le a muda ziehin senel gama a thagam dinga a peipi hizaw hi,’ ci mawh kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate pen na vanglietna le a kizah na ban tawh na peipi nangma’ neisa mite ahi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin Topa in keima kungah, “A masa gel bangin suongpeh ni sehin muoltung ka kungah hing kato inlen, sing singkuong khat bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua suongpeh gel tungah na sekehsa suongpeh masate tunga thu teng kang giel ding a, singkuong sungah tuate na koi ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n gising tawh singkuong khat bawlin, a masa gel bangin suongpeh ni ka seh a, ka khut sungah tua suongpeh gel tawi-in muol tungah ka kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin mihon kikhop ni-in Topa in mei sung panin muoltung na kung vua ang gensa thupieh sawmte, a masa-a kigiel bangin tua suongpehte tungah giel hi; tuale Topa in tua suongpehte kei tungah ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n kihei-in muol tung panin ka kumsuh a, ka bawlsa singkuong sungah tua suongpehte ka koi a, tuale Topa ei thupieh bangin tua sungah suongpehte a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Beeroth-bene-jaakan panin Moserah ah Israel-te khuol zinin khum munah Aaron si-in tua munah kivui hi; a tapa Eleazar in ama’ za luo-in siempu sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mun panin Gudgodah ah amate khuolzinin Gudgodah panin lui tuite a luonna gam Jotbathah ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hun lai-in Topa in tuni donga Topa mai-ah dinga ama’ na sem ding, ama’ min tawh thupha pie ding, le Topa’ thuciemna singkuong puo dingin Levi-te a tuomkoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi tah ziehin Levi in a tanaute lahah tanh hile luo hile a nei sih a, Topa na Pasien un ama kungah a kamciem bangin Topa khu ama’ luo ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A masa-a ka bawl bangin muol tungah sun sawmli le zan sawmli sung ka om hi. Topa in tua hunin zong ka thu ei ngaipieh leuleu hi. Topa in note ang susie nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in kei kungah, “A pu a pate tunga pieh dinga ka ciemsa leitangah pei-in a luo thei nadingun tho inlen, mite mai-ah na khuolzin ban zom in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te aw, tu-in Topa na Pasien un na tung panun bang ang kalh ahei? Na hoi nadingun na Topa na Pasien beh uh zatatin a lampite zosie zui-in, ama na it vua, na lungtang zosie ule na hinna zosie utawh Topa na Pasieh uh’ na semin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuni-a kang gen thupiehte le Topa na Pasien uh’ thukhamte na zui ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vantung le vantungte’ vantung, leitung le a sunga om zosie note’ Topa Pasien-a’ ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hinanle Topa in na pu na pate tung behah itna lungtang a koi a, tuni-a ma bangin mite zosie lah panin amau’ suon le hlah ahi note ang teel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin na lungsim tepte tan unlen lungkhauh nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa na Pasien uh khu a lien Pasien hi a, a thahat, a giinhuoi, deidan a nei lo, guhgol zong a la lo, pasien-te’ Pasien, topate’ Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Meigong tagate adingin ama in thu a tangin khenin pemtate it a, an le puon a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pemtate na it ding uhi, bang ding ahei cile note zong Egypt gamah pemta na hi ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh na zatah ding uhi; ama beh na bie ding uhi; ama na tudet ding vua, ama’ min tawh na kiciem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama na phat ding uh ahi h; ama pen note adinga na mit utawh na musa uh tam a lien le a giinhuoi nate ang bawlpieh pa na Pasien uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Egypt gamah na pu na pate mi sawmsagi a peisuh vua, tu-in Topa na Pasien un vana aasi za-in ang pungsah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh na it ding vua, a thuhilna, a thukhamte, a ngaina kipte, le a thupiehte na zui zing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note in na phaw ding vuah tuni-in na tate uh (na Topa Pasien uh’ khalna a thei nai lo ahi sihle a mu nai lo na tate uh hi loin), a vanglietna, a thahatna, le a kizah a banhat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Egypt kumpi Pharaoh le a gam sung zosie tunga a bawl a limte le a silbawlte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Egypt galkapte, a sakolte le a leengte tunga a sil bawlte; no ang nuadel lai-un San Tuipi in amate a taisah a, Topa in tuni dongin amate a suhsietna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tam mun na tun masangun senel gamah na tung vua ang bawlte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben’ tapa Eliab, a tapa Dathan le Abiram-te tunga a sil bawlte; Israel zosiete laikimah lei in a kamkahin a innkuonpite, a puonbuhte ule a zui mi zosie a valtumnate ngaisun un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile Topa in a bawlsa na lienpi zosiete a unpi-in na mit mama utawh na mu zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin thahatin na luo ding uh leitangah pei-in galkai-in na luo thei nadingun tuni-a na kung vua kang gen tami thupieh zosie a unpi-in zui un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale Topa in na pu na pate ule a suonlehlahte tungah pieh dinga a na ciemsa ahi bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna gamah kum sawt na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen note lutin na va luo ding uh gam khu ante huon ah khaici tu-in na keng vua tui na buohna uh ahi note’ hing peikhietna Egypt gam tawh a kibang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin luo dingin na galkaina uh leitang pen van guotui a ngah muol le guom gam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un a kep leitang ahi hi. Topa na Pasien uh’ mit in kum kipat a kipanin kum tawp dongin tua leitang a mitsuon den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuni-a na tung vua kang gen a thupiehte zosie na man vua, Topa na Pasien uh na lungsim zosie uh, na hinna zosie utawh itin ama’ na na sep uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama in a hunin na leitang vua dingin guo masa le guo nukhia ang zusah ding a, na an uh, na lenggazu, ule na sathau uh na kaikhawm thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in na ganhonte vua dingin na gam sung vuah lodawng ang posah ding a, khamtahin an na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kikemcing un, tua ahi sihle pasien dangte’ na sem ding le tuate bie dingin ang kizawl ding a, tuaci’n na pielmang kha ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />azieh pen na tung vuah Topa’ lungthahna mei bangin ang kuongin ama in vantungte khahcip ding a, tuaci’n guo zu loin leitangah bangma a pieng sih ding hi. Tua ciengin Topa in ang pieh ding uh tua gamhoi-ah na mangthai pai ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami ka thugente na lungsim ule na nuntahna vuah vom lenlon unlen, na khut vuah limin khi-in na zangpai vuah melcina-in na suong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Inn na op ciengun ahi a, na va ciengun ahi zongin, na lup ciengun ahi a, na thaw ciengun ahi zongin, na tate tungah khumte hil unlen genpi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na inn kotkhah mung tung ule na tunkot uh tungah tuate giel unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuaci’n leitung’ a tungah vantungte a op laisie amate tungah pieh dingin Topa in na pu na pate a na ciemsa gam sungah no le na tate na khansau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh itin ama’ lampi zosie na zui vua, ama tudetin kang gen tam thupieh zosie limtaha na zui uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in na masang vuah tam minamte zosie delmang ding a, no sanga minam thupizaw le a thahatzaw minamte na suonmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na keng un a totna mun zosie noma-a’ hi ding a, senel gam panin Lebanon dong le Euphrates Gun panin nitumna tuipi dong na gam uh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note langkhatah koima pang zo lo ding a, ama in ang kamciem bangin Topa na Pasien un na tot ding uh gam zosie-ah note giinna le zatahna a omsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />En un, tuni-in na mai vuah thupha le samsietna ka koi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuni-a kang gen Topa na Pasien uh’ thupiehte na zui uleh thupha ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ thupiehte mang loin tuni kang gen lampi panin na kihei vua, na thei ngai lo uh pasien dangte’ nua na zui uleh samsietna hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Luo dinga na lutna ding uh gamah Topa na Pasien un ang peipi ciengin, Gerizim Muol tungah thupha koi-in Ebal Muol tungah samsietna na koi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na theisa bangun tua muol tegel pen Jodan gal, a gamla simsim nitumna lam, Arabah gam sunga a teng Canaan-te’ gam sung, Gilgal tawh a kigalsai Moreh gangpi sing gei-ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jordan kantanin na nei ding vua Topa na Pasien un ang pieh leitang luo dingin na pei cieng ule tua leitang luo-in na ten ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuni-a na mai vua kang koipieh thukhamte le ngaina kipte zosie limtaha na zui ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen na pu na pate uh’ Topa Pasien in leitunga na ten laisie-un na luo ding vua ang piehsa gam sungah limtaha na zui ding uh thukhamte le ngaina kipte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na suonmang ding uh minamte in a bieh pasien-te opna mun, muol sangte, muoltangte, le singnim nei zosie na susie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A maitamte uh phelmangin a khuom siengthote satguoi a, a khuom siengthote mei tawh haltumin a pasien-te’ uh limte zong mei tawh haltum un. Tuaci’n amau’ munte panin a min uh na phietmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua bang dan tawh Topa na Pasien uh na bie sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na minam zosie uh sung panin ama’ min koi nadingin teelin ama op nadinga a bawlna mun na suizaw ding uhi. Khum munah na pei ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />na meihal biehnate ule na biehpiehnate uh, na sawm-ah-khatte ule na silpiehte uh, na kamciem uh letsongte, nop thu-a na pieh uh biehnate le na bawnghonte ule na tuuhon tacilte uh, khum tahah na peipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ mai khum munah na ne ding vua, Topa na Pasien un na sepna zosie vuah thupha ang pieh ziehin no le na innkuonpite na kipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eite zosie in hoi i sah dan bangin tam munah i bawl bangun na gamta sih ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />azieh pen Topa na Pasien un na luo ding vua ang pieh gam le tawlngahna mun na lut nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan gun galkai-in Topa na Pasien un luo dinga ang pieh leitangah na ten cieng ule, lungnuomin na ten thei nadingun na kimvel vua om na galte uh panin bihtahin tawlngahna ang pieh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un ama’ min ten nadinga a teelna munah kang thupieh zosie na peipi ding uhi: Tua teng pen na meihal biehnate ule na biehpiehnate uh, na sawm-ah-khatte ule na silpiehte uh, Topa tunga na kamciemsa uh ahi na deituom uh letsong zosie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah na tanu na tapate uh, na sila uh numei pasalte le na khuo sung vua a teng Levi-te tawh na lungdam ton ding uhi. (bangzieh ahei cile amate in tanh ahi a, luo ahi zongin a nei sih uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tuona mun po vuah na meihal biehnate na pieh lo nadingun kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle na minamte uh sung panin Topa in a teelna mun khat behah na meihal biehnate na pie ding vua, khum munah kang thupieh zosie na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle Topa na Pasien un ang pieh thupha tawh kizui-in na khuopite uh khat popo sungah na dei hunhun-un sa go-in na ne thei ding uhi; sangai le sakhi sate a kineh ma bangin a sieng le a bua kideidan loin na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin a si na ne sih ding uhi; tui bangin tuolah na buo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na khuopite sung vuah na an uh sawm-a- khatte, na lenggazu ule na sathaute uh, na bawnghonte ule na tuuhonte uh sung panin tacilte, pieh dinga na kiciemsa uh letsongte khat popo ahi sihle kiphalna tawh na pieh uh biehnate le na silpiehte uh na ne thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un a teel nading mun, na Topa Pasien uh mai-ah, note le na tanu na tapate uh, na sila pasalte, na sila numeite, le na khuopi sung vua a teng Levi-te in na ne ding vua, na sepna zosie vuah Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah na kipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na gam sung vuah na ten laisie-un Levi-te na thusim lo khah ding uh kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ang kamciemsa ma bangin Topa na Pasien un na gam uh ang kehpieh ciengin sa na du ziehun, “Sa ka ne ding uhi,” ci po locin sa na du hunhunun na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note kung panin Topa in ama’ min op nadinga a teelna mun a gamlat seng leh note kang thupiehsa bangin Topa in ang piehsa na bawnghonte uh pan ahi a, na tuuhonte uh pan ahi zongin khat popo na go thei ding vua, tuaci’n na khuopite sung vuah na du hunhunun na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sangai ahi a, sakhi ahi zongin a kineh bangin na ne thei ding uhi; mi a sieng le a buate in a kibangin na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A si na neh lo ding beh uh thei siem un; bangzieh ahei cile sisan khu hinna ahi a, sa tawh hinna na neton sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua sisan ne loin tui bangin tuolah na buo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa muna-ah a dihin na gamtat ziehun noma le na nua vua na tate uh a nopsah thei nadingin tua si ne sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanle na pieh ding uh silpieh siengthote, le na kiciemsa uh letsongte la-in Topa in a teel nading munah na peipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa na Pasieh uh’ maitam tungah na meihal biehnate uh’ a sa le a si na pieton ding uhi; na Topa Pasien uh’ maitam gei-ah note in adang na biehpiehnate uh’ site na sung ding vua, ahi vangin a sa na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ mitmu-in a hoi le a dihin na gamtat ziehun, note le na nua vua na tate a khantanun a nopsah den thei nadingin tuni-a kang gen tam thute zosie man dingin ngaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na mai vua na suonmang ding uh minamte hemkhie-in, amate suon dingin a leitang vuah na ten ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />na mai vuah amate a kisuhsiet zaw ciengin amate zui-in na awkhah lo nadingun kidawm un: “Tam minamte in amau’ pasien-te a bangci bieh uh ahei? Ke’n zong tua bangin bawl nuom ing,” ci-in a pasien-te tawh kisai thute kan sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh tungah tua bangin na bawl sih ding uhi. Azieh pen amau’ pasien-te dinga a kidahhuoi a silbawlte zosie uh Topa in muda hi. Amau’ pasien-te dingin a tapate ule a tanute nangawn uh mei sungah a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kang thupieh zosie limtahin na zui ding uhi; tua khu belap loin zong na lakhie sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note lahah kamsangte ahi a, mangsante ahi zongin ang khan a, theisahna limte ahi a, ahi sihle hilkholnate ahi zongin kang lah ding hi, ci-in ang kamciem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a gen uh tua theisahna limte le hilkholna limte ang tangtun a, tuale amate in, “Adang pasien-te zui-in (na thei ngai lo uh pasien-te) tuate bie vai,” ang ci uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua kamsangte’ thu ahi a, mangsante’ thu ahi zongin na thuse sih ding uhi; azieh pen Topa note’ Pasien khu na lungsim zosie ule na hinna zosie utawh na it tahtah uh amah ci-a Topa in ang zelahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ nua zui-in ama na zatah ding vua, a thupiehnate zui-in a thu na mang ding vua, ama’ na sem in ama na tukip ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hizongle tua kamsangte ahi a, mangsante ahi zongin kithat ding hi. Azieh pen Topa na Pasien un na zui ding vua ang thupieh lampi pana na piel nading ule Egypt gam panin hing peipi-in saltanna inn pana ang tan Topa na Pasien uh langpan ding thu a gen uhi. Tuaci’n na sung panun sietna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na sanggampa, na pa’ tapa, ahi sihlna nu’ tapa, ahi sihle nangma’ tapa, ahi sihle nangma’ tanu, ahi sihle na kawilai na zi, ahi sihle na it pen na guolpa nangawn in ang dapzawl a, nangma le na pu na pate un a thei ngai lo uh pasiente, na kim na pam uh a nai a gamla, leimong khat pan mong khat a om mite in a bieh pasien dangte khatpo, “Va pei-in va bie ta vai,” ang ci leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua bang mite’ thugen mang loin zong na thudon sih ding uhi. Amate tungah khuotuona le lainatna nei loin zong na dal sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate na that zaw lai ding uhi; amate that dingin a tung vuah na khut na lam masa pen ding a, tua zaw ciengin mi zosie in ang zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in saltanna gam Egypt pana ang peipi Topa na Pasien uh kung panin na piel nading uh a hanciem ziehin suong tawh ama na seplia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te zosie in tua thu za-in a zausi ding vua, tua bang gitlona a bawlkia ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un tenna dinga ang pieh khuopi khat popo-ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mi ginalo pawlkhat note lah panin peikhie dawhin, “Va pei-in na thei ngai nai lo uh pasien dangte va bie ta vai,” ci-in khuopi sunga a tengte a puikhiel lam na zah uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a thu na kan ding vua, limtahin sittelna na nei ding uhi. Note lahah tua bang a kidahhuoi na a kisem tahpi ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />namsau tawh tua khuopi sunga tengte thatin khuo sung mi zosie le a ganhonte uh zong namsau tawh na susie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na vanlah zosie uh khuopi sung mipi kikhopna-ah khawmin khuopi le galvan kila zosie na Topa Pasien uh tungah meihal biehna bangin a bupin mei tawh haltum un; tua khuopi khu buathah kholna ahi zing ta ding a, a kilamkia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na pu na pate tungah Topa a kiciem bangin, a zauhuoi ama’ lungthahna panin kihei a, na tung vuah ama’ lainatna hing lahin tua ama’ lainatna sungah note ang punsah thei nadingin, suhsiet dinga a ki-apsa na khatpopo na khut sung vuah omsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni-a na kung vua kang gen bangin Topa na Pasien uh’ aw ngai-in ama’ thupiehte zosie na zui uleh, Topa na Pasien uh’ muna-ah a dih nate a sem na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note na hi uleh Topa na Pasien uh’ tate na hi uhi. Misite ziehin noma le noma kikuikeh sih unlen, na humsam zong heukieu sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa na Pasien uh tungah a siengtho mite na hi uhi; leitung mi zosie lah panin ama’ nei gougil dinga Topa in ang teelsa na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kidahhuoi na khat popo na ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na neh thei ding uh ganhingte tam teng ahi hi: Bawng, tuu, keel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sakhitang, sangai, sim sakhi, sathah, saza, zo sakhi, le gamtuu-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ganhingte lah panin a kecin a kaa, ehnel a hlai ganhing kici poma na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ehnel hlai a, a kecin a kaa zongin tam bang sate na ne thei sih ding uhi: Kalaoh, bilpi, le sakihte in ehnel a hai vangin a kecin a kaa lo ziehin note adingin a nieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Voh a kecin a kaa vangin ehnel hlai lo ahi ziehin note dingin a nieh ahi hi. Tuate’ sa na ne sih ding vua, a luong zong na tham sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tui sunga om zosie lah panin hla le lip a nei zosie na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hla le lip a nei lo poma na ne sih ding uhi; tua khu note adingin a nieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Va sieng zosie na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam teng na ne sih ding uhi: Muvanlai, langta, luimu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mumeika, mukhau namcin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />va-ah nam zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />va-kalaoh, pengpeleuh, vatawt, musi nam zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />keising le simbu, gam vatawt,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />le senel-simbu, musane le tuimu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />gun vapi, tui va kengsau nam popo; lailen le baah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hla a nei insect ganhing zosie note adingin a sienglo ahi hi; tuate kine lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hla a nei ganhing a sieng poma na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A mawhsi ganhing poma na ne sih ding uhi; na khuo sung vua a teng khuol mite neh dingin na pie thei vua, ahi sihle gamdang mite kungah na zua thei ding uhi. Azieh pen Topa na Pasien uh tungah a siengtho mi na hi uhi. Keelno a pi’ nawizu tawh na huonton sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumsielin na lo vua a pieng, na khaici panun a pieng zosie sawm-ah-khat na tuomkoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh na zatah zing thei nadingun, ama’ min ten nadinga a teelna mun Topa na Pasien uh’ mai-ah na an uh, na lenggazu uh, na sathau uh sawm-ah-khat le na bawnghonte ule na tuuhon tacilte uh na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hizongle Topa na Pasien un thupha ang pieh ciengin, na Topa Pasien un a min koi nadinga a teel mun khu na kung panun a gamlat seng ziehin sawm-ah-khat na puoh zawh sih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuate sum na suo ding uhi. Na khut sung vuah tua sumte na tawi ding vua, Topa na Pasien un a teelna munah pei-in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />na lunggul popo uh bawngtang, tuu, lenggazu, kham thei zu, ahi sihle na du popo uh leina-in tua sumte na zang ding uhi. Na Topa Pasien uh’ mai khum munah kipah tahin noma le na innkuonpite tawh na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na khuo sung vua a teng Levi-te in tanh le luo ding a nei lo ziehun amate thuse loin om sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kum thum a cin sielin tua kuma a pieng na an uh’ sawm-ah-khat zosie peipi-in na khuo sung vuah na khol ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na sep na bawlna zosie vuah thupha ang pieh thei nadingin note bangin tanh ahi a, luo ahi zongin a nei lo ziehun na khuo sung vua a om Levi-te, pemtate, tagate, meigong numeite pei-in khamtahin tua ante a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sagi a cin sielin leiba maisahna na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maisahna ding dan tam bang ahi hi: Mi a leitawi poma in a vengte’ bat leibate maisah ding hi. Topa’ maisahna kiphuong zo ahi ziehin leitawi a pie poma in a sanggampa’ bat ahi a, a mipi a vengpa’ bat leiba ahi zongin phulkia nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamdang mite kung panin na phul thei ding vua, hizongnanle na sanggam khat popo in noma-a’ ang batte na maisah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin note lahah a tasam koima om lo ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa na Pasien un na luo ding ule na nei ding vua ang pieh leitangah Topa in thupha ang pie valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khu note kang pieh Topa na Pasien uh’ thu mangin tuni-a kang gen tami thupiehte zosie limtaha na zui uleh cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un note ang kamciemsa bangin thupha ang pieh ciengin, minam tampite na leitawisah ding vua, ahi vangin nomate in koima-a’ na leitawi sih ding uh; minam tampite tungah vai na hawm ding vua, hizongle no tungah amate in vai a hawm sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un ang pieh ding gama na khuote uh khat popo sungah na sanggam khat uh note lahah a tasam a op leh na lungtang khausah sih unlen, tua a tasam na vengpa hu lo-in om sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note na vautat zaw ding vua, a kisap za phaltahin na leitawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A kum sagina, maisahna kum hing nai ta hi,” ci-in na lungsim sung vuah ngaisutna gilo khat ang omin, a tasam na vengpa uh galbawlin bangma pie loin na op lo nadingun kidawm un; na vengpa zong ang kiko-in Topa tungah ang khie kha thei ding a, tua hile khielna bawl na suoh ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hlawnna-in na pie ding vua, na pieh ciengun zong kiphal tahin na pie ding uhi. Azieh pen Topa na Pasien un tam thu ziehin na sep na bawlna zosie vuah thupha ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitungah mi tasam tawp ngai lo ding a, tua ahi ziehin, “Gam sunga om mizawngte le tasam sanggamte tungah phaltahin na pie ding uhi,” ci-in thu kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na unau, Hebrew pasal khat ahiei, ahi sihle Hebrew numei khat ahiei na kungah ang kizua-in kum guh sung na na ang seppieh leh, a kum sagina ciengin tua mipa na suohta sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangma kung panin sila pasal khat a suohta-in na peisah ciengin a khutguohin na peisah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tuuhonte lah, na ancilna lah le na lengga suhna lah panin phalna tawh na pie ding a, Topa na Pasien in thupha ang piehna bangin na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt gamah sila na hina ule Topa na Pasien un ang tatkhiet uh ahi lam phawh un; tam thu ziehin tuni-in na tung vuah tam thupieh kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hizongle ama in nuom hing sa-in, nangma le na innkuonpite ang it ziehin, “Na kung panin ka pei sih ding hi,” ang ci vawt tah leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />siatul khat la-in kotbieng dappha-in a bil na vut ding a, tuaci’n ama na sila ahi zing ta ding hi. Na sila numei zong tam bangma-in na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma kung panin a suohta-in na peisah ciengin hamsa ngaisut sin. Bang ding ahei cile a kiciel nasemte’ thamanza tawh kum guh sung nangma’ na ang sep pieh zo ta uhi; tuale Topa na Pasien un na sepna zosie vuah thupha ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na bawnghon ule na tuuhon panun tacil apa poma Topa na Pasien uh tungah na siensuo ding uhi; na bawnghon tacilte utawh na semton loin, na tuuhon tacilte uzong a mul na heu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in a teelna munah a kum kumin Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah na innkuonpite utawh na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin poina khatpo, a khelbai a mittaw, ahi sihle poina gol a nei khat popo ahile, Topa na Pasien uh tungah biehpiehna-in na pie sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sangai ahiei sakhi ahiei na neh bangun, na khuo sung vuah mi buate le mi siengte in a kibangin na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin a sisan na ne sih ding uhi; tui bangin tuolah a si na buo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un Abib hla sungin Egypt panin zanin note ang peipi ziehun Abib hla tang unlen, Topa na Pasien vua dingin peisan pawi-in mang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in ama’ min ten nadinga a teel ding munah tuuhon pan ahi a, bawnghon pan ahi zongin Topa na Pasien vua dingin peisan pawi biehpiehna na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua pen tol kisaw anlum tawh na me sih ding uhi. Na khang tawntungun Egypt gam pana nang peikhiet ni uh na phaw zing nadingun tol saw lo anlum ahi gimna anlum tawh ni sagi sung na me ding uhi. Azieh pen Egypt gam panin bungle benga ang peikhie na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na gam sung zosie vuah ni sagi sung note lahah tol kici a kimu sih ding hi. A ni masa nitahin na gawsa uh sa khat zong zan thapai-in zingmawng dong na omsah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un ang pieh ding na khuopite uh khat popo-ah peisan pawi biehpiehna na lui thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un ama’ min a ten nadinga a teelna mun behah nitum zaw nitah, Egypt gam pana na peikhiet uh hunin peisan pawi biehpiehna na lui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un a teel ding munah huonin na ne ding uhi; zingmawng ciengin na puonbuh vuah na peikia thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni guh sung tol saw lo anlum na nezom ding vua, a ni sagi ni-in Topa na Pasien vua dingin a thupi kikhopna khat na nei ding uhi. Tua ni-in na na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phieukawi tawh bu na at ni vua kipanin nipikal sagi na simto ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa na Pasien uh kung pana na nga uh thupha dung zui-in nop thu-a biehna tawh Topa na Pasien vua dingin nipikal pawi na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh mai, ama’ min om nadinga Topa na Pasien un a teel ding munah, noma le na tapate, na tanute, na sila pasalte, na sila numeite, na khuopite sunga om Levi-te, note lahah a om gamdang mite, pa nei lote, le meigong numeite tawh na lungdam ton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Egypt gamah sal na hina uh phawh unlen, tam thukhamte limtahin zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ancilna ule na lengga suhna panun an na kaikhop ciengun ni sagi sung buh pawi na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pawi bawl sungun nangma le na tapa na tanute, na sila pasalte le na sila numeite, Levi-te, gamdang mite, pa nei lote, le na khuo sung vua a om meigong numeite tawh na lungdam ton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in a teel nading munah Topa na Pasien vua dingin ni sagi sung pawi na bawl ding uhi. Azieh pen Topa na Pasien un na hlawsa ule na sepna zosie vuah thupha hing pie ding ahi ziehin pawi na bawl hamtang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un a teel ding mun ama mai-ah na pasal zosie uh kum khatin thumvei kilaa ding uhi: Tolsaw lo anlum pawi, nipikal pawi, le buh pawi-te ah zong kilaa ding uhi. Topa mai-ah khut guoh tawh na kilaa sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un thupha ang piehza uh zui-in mi zosie in ahi theina za tawh a pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un note ang pieh ding na khuopi zosie vuah, na minam sung teng vuah thukhente le uliente na koi ding vua, mite adingin a manin thu a khen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note in thutang na leheisih ding uhi; huptuom paituom zong na nei sih ding uhi; note in guhgol na ne sih ding uhi, azieh pen guhgol in mipilte’ mit tawsah a, midihte’ dihna lehei pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note nungta-in Topa na Pasien un ang pieh ding leitangah tengin na luo thei nadingun thutang behbeh na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa na Pasien vua dinga na siem uh maitam gei-a khuom siengtho adingin sing khuom khat popo na phut sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un a muda ahi suong tawh kibawl biehna song zong na phut sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawng ahi a, tuu ahi zongin, poina a nei, kisapna khat a nei poma Topa na Pasien uh’ tungah biehpiehna-a na nei lo ding uh ahi hi; azieh pen tua khu Topa na Pasien vua dingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un note ang pieh ding ahi khuopite khatah note lahah a teng pasal ahi a, numei ahi zongin a thuciemna palsatin Topa na Pasien uh’ muna-ah a siet gamtatna a kimu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />keima in ka kham pasien dangte ahi ni ahi a, hla ahi a, vantunga om na khat popo’ na sem dingin pei-in tuate bie-in ahi zongin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na kung vuah tuate ang kigenin a thu na zah uleh limtahin na kantel ding vua, Israel-te sungah tua bang kidahhuoi nate a pieng tahpi ma ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua ciengin a siet gamtat numei ahi a, pasal ahi zongin na khuo pulam vuah peipi-in numei ahi a, pasal ahi zongin suong tawh na seplia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Teci ni ahi sihle thum genna tawh sina thu kikhen ding hi; teci khat beh’ thu genna tawh mi kithat lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tecite in a kithat ding pa tungah a khut uh a hlang masa ding vua, tua zaw ciengin mipi zosie in a khut uh a hlang ding uhi. Tuaci’n note lah panin sietna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khuo sung vuah mi khatlekhat kithana, mi khatlekhat dih kituna, mi khatlekhat kivuoh kisatnate ang op a, note dingin thu hamsa seng ang op leh, Topa na Pasien un a teel ding munah thakhatin peito-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua huna thukhen ding Levi siempute le thukhente na kikuppi ding uhi; amate in zong na kung vuah thukhenna ding ang gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in a teel ding mun panin na kung vua ang gen bangun na bawl ding vua, ang kihil vannuoi limtahin na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noma dinga ang gen uh thukham ahi sihle na kung vua ang zahsah uh thukhensatna bangin a unpi-in na zui ding uhi; na kung vua amate in ang gen thukhensatnate panin veilam ahi a, zietlam ahi zongin na piel sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ kungah a na sem dinga kikoi ahi siempu pa’ thu ahi a, thukhenpa’ thu ahi zongin mang loin a valkai-a a gamta mi poma kithat ding hi. Tuaci’n Israel-te sung panin sietna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi zosie in za-in a zausi ding vua, a valkai-in a gamta nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un ang pieh ding gam luo-in na ten zaw uh, “I kimvela om minam zosiete bangin ei uh ding kumpi khat i koi ding hi,” na ci ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />na tung vuah kumpi-in Topa na Pasien un a teel mipa na koi thei tahpi ding uhi. Na tung vuah kumpi-in na sanggamte lah vuah khat penpen na koi thei ding uhi; na sanggam uh ahi lo gamdang mi khat kumpi-in na koi thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua nangawn zong ama’ aituomin sakol tampi nei thei lo ding hi. Topa in na kung vuah, “Khum lampi-ah na kilekia ngai sih ding uhi,” ang cisa ahi ziehin, ama in sakol lei be dingin Egypt gamah mite a peisahkia sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lungsim a kiheimang lo nadingin ama dingin zi tampi a lahbe sih ding; ama dingin ngun le kham zong a valkai-in a khol sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kumpi topha tungah a to ciengin Levi siempute mai-ah ama adinga a kiteisawn tami thukham bu khat nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in tami thukham sunga a om thute le tam ngainate limtaha a zuina tawh, Topa a Pasien zatah dan a thei nading, a mite tungah kilietsahna lungsim a nei lo nading, thupiehnate a zietlam ahiei a veilam ahiei-ah a pielsan lo nading le, Israel kumpi gam sungah ama le a suon a hlahte in sauveipi sung vai a hawm thei nadingun tami laibu khomvom ding a, a hin sung tungtawnin tua sunga om thute sim ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siempu ahi Levi minam zosie in Israel-te bangin tanh ahi a, luo ahi zongin a nei sih ding vua, amate in Topa’ tanh ahi biehpiehnate a ne thei ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hinanle a unau dangte lahah luo a nei sih ding uhi; ama in amate tungah a ciem bangin Topa khu amau’ luo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite pieh biehpiehnate lah panin bawng ahi a, tuu ahi zongin siempute’ kaih ding ahi hi: Siempute tungah a lieng, a khagu ni le a gilpi a pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na anpal, na lenggazu, na sathau, na heu masah uh na tuumul uh na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa’ min tawh na sem den dingin Topa na Pasien un na minam zosie lah panun Levi-te a teelsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi-te khat in Israel gamah a tenna, na khuopite uh khat popo nuasie-in Topa’ teelna munah a nop hun hunin ang pei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa mai-ah na sema om a guol Levi-te zosie ma bangin Topa a Pasien’ minin na sem thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in innkuon’ van neite a zuana uh panin sumlut nei nan ule, amate tawh a kikimin neh ding satanh nga ton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un note ang pieh ding gamah na tun ciengun, a mudahuoi khum mite’ gamtatnate na zui sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note lahah a tapa ahi a, a tanu ahi zongin meihal kithoina-a a zang, ai a san, khutlam a en, mailam thu a gen, ai a tawi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />bum a zang, sihla thu a dong, a sisate thu a dong koima kimu lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile tam teng a sem poma Topa adingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi; tam bang a kidahhuoi gamtatnate ziehin Topa na Pasien un na mai panun amate notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh tungah na citah den ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na suonmang dawh ding uh tam minamte in khutlam ente le aisante thu a ngai vua, hizongle note na hi ule tua bangin na gamtat ding uh Topa na Pasien un ang phal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un noma dingin na sanggamte uh lah panin keima tawh a kibang kamsang khat ang khangsah ding hi; note in tua kamsangpa thu na ngai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Horeb muolah na kikhop ni-un, “Si kha ding ka hi ziehun Topa ka Pasien uh’ aw ei zasahkia nawn sin. Tam meikuong vanglien zong ei musah nawn sin,” ci-in Topa na Pasien uh kungah tam thu na ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in kei tam bangin ei dawngkia hi: “A thugente uh man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate dingin a minam sung panun nangma tawh a kibang kamsang khat ka khangsah ding hi; keima in kamsangpa’ kam sungah ka thute ka koi ding a, amate tunga ka thupieh zosie a unpi-in a gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka min tawh a gen ding kamsangpa’ thugen a don lo poma kei mama in ka mawsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hizongle kamsang khat in kei thupieh lopi-in ka min tawh thu a gen ngam a, ahi sihle pasien dangte’ min tawh thu a gen leh, tua kamsangpa si ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lungsim sung vuah, “ Topa’ gen lo thu bang i ci thei uh ahei na ci kha thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kamsang khat in Topa’ min tawh thu genin tua thu ang tun sih a, ang man sih leh tua thu khu Topa’ gen ahi sih hi. Tua khu kamsangpa in a uong get ahi bo hi; Ama na giin ding uh hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un a gam uh note ang pieh minamte a suhsiet zaw, note in zong amate suonin a khuopite ule a innte vuah na ten zaw ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na luo ding vua ang pieh gam sungah khuopi thum na tuomkoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuolthat khat popo tua khuote khat penpen ah a tai thei nadingin, Topa na Pasien un na luo ding vua ang pieh tua leitang a gamlatna na te ding vua, mun thumin na khen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami pen sawmhlim hi loin kigalbawlna zong om ngai lopi-in mi khat a that hai kha, khum munah tai-in a teng mithat pa’ kungtung thu ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gentena-in, mi khat sing phua dingin adang khat tawh gamlah pei-in, khat zawhsang in sing phua dingin a hei lamto a, tuale a heiga panin a heitang kitawhin a guolpa satkha-in tua pa a si leh; tua mithat pa tai-in tam khuopite khat popo-ah ama’ hinna a hu thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hizongle ama gel kigalnei ngai lo ahi ziehin sina thuoh dinga kilawm lo hi tama le, phula nuompa in a lungthah sulin nua delin lampi a gamlat ziehin ama pha-in tua mithat hai kha pa mawh tha kha thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in thu kang pie hi: Khuopi thum na tuomkoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na pu na pate uh tungah kiciemin amate tungah gam buppi a khap bangin na gam uh ang kehpieh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuni-a kang pieh thukhamte zosie limtahin zui a, Topa na Pasien uh itin ama’ lampi na zui zingna uh ahi ziehin tua khuopite banah adang khuopi thum ma na belap lai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa na Pasien un na luo ding vua ang pieh ding leitang tungah maw baang lo mi khat’ sisan luong loin, na tung vuah tua sisan mawna ang tun lo nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khat in adang khat muda a, ama na buhdapin na vuo na satin tua mipa a tha a, tua khuopite lahah khat pen pena a tai leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />mithat pa’ khuo upate in tua mun panin ama peisahin tha dingin phulapa kungah ap ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama na khuotuo sih ding uhi; note na nopsah thei nadingun Israel-te sung panin maw baang lote’ sisan luonsahna zieha khielna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na nei ding vua ang pieh ding gam, le ang kipie ding leitang tungah khanglui mite in a na phusa uh na vengte’ kigisuong khin sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi khat in a bawlkhah mawna khatpo ahi a, khielna khatpo a bawlna-ah ahi zongin tua mipa mawsah nadingin teci khat beh kicing lo ding hi. Teci ni ahi sihle teci thum thugenna tawh mawsahna kikipsah pan beh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huotna lungsim a nei teci khat in mi khat’ tatkhielna a mawsah dinga a pei leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thukinei tegel a ni tuohin Topa mai le khum huna siempute le thukhente mai-ah a kilaa ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaci’n thukhente in limtahin kanin teci pa pen teci zuou ahi a, adang khat pa’ langkhatah a man lopi-a teci pang ahile
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />adang khat tungah ama in bawl dinga a sawm bang lienin ama tungah na bawl ding uhi. Tuaci’n note sung panin sietna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A omlai mite in za-in a zau ding vua, note lahah tam bang mawna lien a bawlkia ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi na khuotuo sih ding uhi: hinna tangin hinna, mit tangin mit, ha tangin ha, khut tangin khut, keng tangin keng hi ciet ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na galte do dingin na kuon vua, sakolte le a leengte, le a galkapte uh no-a’ sangin a tamzaw-a na mu ciengun amate na giing sih ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Egypt gam pana ang peipi Topa na Pasien un note ang ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gal na do masangun siempu pa a mai-ah pei-in galkapte hopi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a tung vuah tam bangin gen ding hi: “Israel-te aw, za un! Tuni-in na galte do dingin na nai uhi. Lungkie sih un, zau sih un, patau sih unlen amahaw giing sih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />azieh pen na tung vuah guolzawna ang pie ding, na galte ang dopi dingin note tawh ang kuonton pa khu Topa na Pasien uh ahi hi,” ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin uliente in a galkapte kungah thu a gen ding vua, “Inn tha lam zo napi a ap nai lo a om ei mah? Gal sungah ama si-in midang khat in a inn ap kha ding ahi ziehin a inn ah ama peikia leh hoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lenggui huon bawl zo napi a ga ne nai lo na om uh amah? Gal sungah ama si-in midang khat in a ga ne kha ding ahi ziehin a inn ah ama peikia leh hoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A zi ding dong zo napi a tenpi nai lo koi om ahei? Gal sungah ama si-in midang khat in tua numei la kha ding ahi ziehin a inn ah ama peikia leh hoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Uliente in galkapte kungah thu a genbe lai ding vua, “A zau, a lungkie koi om ahei? Ama lungkieh bang ma-in a guolte lungkiesah kha ding ahi ziehin a inn ah ama peikia leh hoi ding hi,” a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uliente in galkapte kungah a thugen a manzaw ciengiu, a tung vua a vaihawm dingin galkapmangte se ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuopi khat do dinga na neh ciengun kilemna thu genpi masa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kilemna thu gen uh ang san thei vua, na tung vua ang ki-ap uleh tua sunga om mi zosie in thona-aana tawh na na ang seppieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kung vuah kilemna dei-in ang ki-ap sih vua ang do zawsop uleh, tua khuo na imtawm pai ding uhi; tuale
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na khut sung vuah tua khuo ang pieh ciengin namsau tawh pasal zosie na that ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin noma adingin numeite, naupangte, ganhingte, le khuo sunga adang na zosie, a kinuasie van zosie na la ding vua, Topa na Pasien un note ang piehsa na galte’ vante utawh na nuomsa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam nai-a khuopite ahi lo, no kung pana a gamla khuopi zosie tungah hici bangin na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa na Pasien un na luo ding vua ang pieh tam mite’ khuopite sunga a om hinna nei zosie na hinkhawi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un thu ang piehsa bang lienin Hit-te le Amor-te, Canaan-te le Perez-te, Hiv-te le Jebus-te na sumaimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pasien-te dinga a bawl uh ahi a kidahhuoi gamtatnate zosie ang hil thei lo nading ule note in zong Topa na Pasien uh tungah tuaci banga na maw lo nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuopi khat lah thei nadingin tua khuopi simin sawtveipi na imtawm uleh, khuopi-a singkungte’ hei tawh na phua sih ding uhi. Tuate panin a ga na neh thei vangun tua singkungte na phua sih ding uhi. Note ang imtawm dingin gamlaha om singkungte mihing ahi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ga a kine thei lo singkung hi, ci-in na thei teng beh uh na susie ding uhi. Na kidopi uh khuo na lah zawh masangsie-un imtawmna-a na zah dingun tuate na phua thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na nei ding vua ang pieh ding leitang tunga lopangah si luong lum khat kimu-in a that a kithei sih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na upate ule na thukhente uh pei-in khumi tuol luong lupna kima khuopite a gamlatna te ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siluong tawh kinai pen khuo upate in na sem nai lo, kol kivaw nai lo, bawnglaa khat a kai ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua khuopi upate in lo-a kihlo nai lo, khaici zong a kivaw ngai nai lo, le a kang ngai lo tuiluong opna lui khatah tua bawnglaa kaisuhin tuami lui-ah bawnglaa’ ngawng a tan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa na Pasien un a na sem ding le Topa’ min tawh thupha a pie dinga Levi siempute a teelsa ahi ziehin amate pei-in kithuneina le kihauna zosie amau’ thu tawh kikhen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kithat mipa tawh kinai pen khuopi upa zosie in lui sunga a ngawng kitan bawnglaa tungah khut a sil ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka khut un tam sisan a luongsah sih a, a kitha lam zong ka mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, na hutdamsa na mi Israel-te’ mawna ei maisah in; na mi Israel-te lahah midih sisan luonna omsah sin,” ci-in a tangko ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa muna-ah a manin na gamtat ziehun note lah panin maw baang lo sisan suona na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na galte uh do dingin na kuon vua, Topa na Pasien un na khut sung vuah amate hing pie-in salin na mat ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />salte lahah numei melhoi khat mu-in, tua nu deigaw-in na tenpi nuom vua ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />na inn vuah tua numei na zawpi ding uhi: Ama in a sam heukieu-in a cin tan ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a sila puonte suo dawhin na inn sungah hla khat bup ang omin a nu a pa ngai-in a kap ding hi; tua zaw ciengin ama na luppi thei pan ding a, nang a pasal hi-in, ama na zi hi thei pan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama tunga na lungkim zo sih leh, a nopna po-ah na peisah ding hi. Ama na daisahsa ahi ziehin sum tawh zua lo-in sila bangin zong na bawl sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi khat in zi ni nei a, khat dei-in a khat dei lo a, a deinu le a deilo nu in ta nei tuohin a tapa neicil pen a deilo nu tawh a hin ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a tapate tungah a neisa goute a hawmpieh ciengin a deilo nu’ tapa sangin a deinu’ tapa a deisah zawh ziehin a deinu’ tapa pen a ta cilin bawl thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a deilo nu’ tapa pen a tacilin pom ding a, a nei zosie’ tanh ni pie ding hi. Bang ding ahei cile tua pa pen a pa’ thahatna tawh a pieng masa pen ahi ziehin tacil hina za ama-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi khat in a lungpheng, a ledo thei, nu thu pa thu ngai lo, a kihil cienga thu a mang nuom lo tapa khat a nei leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a nu le a pa in a khuopi upate kung, khuopi tunkotah tua mipa peipi-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />amate in a khuo upate kungah, “Tam ka tapa uh pen mi lungpheng le mi ledo thei, sap thei lo le zuhai anhai bep ahi hi,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuo pasal zosie in suong tawh ama seplia ding uhi. Tuaci’n na laizang vuah sietna na hemkhie ding uhi; tuale Israel-te zosie in za-in zau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi khat in sina cing mawna bawlin ama kithat a, sing tung khatah ama a khai ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />sing tungah zan tungtawnin a luong om lo ding hi; khumi ni ma-in na vui pai ding uhi, azieh pen sing tunga kikhai mi poma Pasien’ samsietna thuoh ahi hi. Topa na Pasien un luo dinga ang pieh ding na leitang uh na buasah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na vengpa’ bawngtang ahi a, a tuu ahi zongin a gammang na mu vua ahile kitheimaw bawl loin a neipa kungah na kaikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kim nai vuah a neipa teng loin a nei na thei sih uleh na inn vuah kai-in, a nei pa in ang nget masangsie na kem ding uhi; tua ciengin na piekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na vengpa’ laa zong tua bang ma-in na bawl ding uhi; a puonsilte zong tua ma bangin na bawl ding uhi; na vengpa in a mansuo adang na mukiate uzong tua ma bangin na bawl ding uhi. Panpi loin na om sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na vengte’ laa ahi a, bawngtang ahi zongin lam lai-a pua na mu uleh na kitheimaw bawl sih ding uhi; note in na phawhto piehkia ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Numei in pasal’ puon sil loin pasal in zong numei’ puon sil lo ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile tua banga a gamta poma Topa na Pasien uh adinga a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Singdawn ahi a, lei lah ahi zongin vabu khat a no ahi a, a tui tawh ahi zongin omin a pi in a no ahi a, a tui ahi zongin a op laitah na mu uleh, a no tawh a pi na lahtha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na nopsah nading ule sauvei na hin thei nadingun a pi hla-in a no beh na la ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inn tha na lam ciengun na innkhumzang kimvel vuah a imna na bawl ding uhi; tua tung panin mi a kieh leh tua inn ah sisan suosah mawna na tut lo nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lenggui lo vuah khaici nam ni na vaw sih ding vua, na vaw uleh na vawsa uh ankung le na lenggui lo vua piengte a nipi-in kisie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawngtang khat le laa khat hahkol vawtonin lo na kaisah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samul le patkhau a kiganton puon na sil sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kihuina na puonzal uh a gei ning lite tungah puonmongtep na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gentena-in pasal khat in numei khat a tenpi a, ahi vangin ama a luppi zaw ciengin dei nawn loin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua nu mawsah a, “Tami numei zi-in ka nei hi. Ahi vangin ama tawh ka lupton ciengin ngahnu siengtho a hina lim mawngmawng ka mu sih hi,” ci-in tua nu a mindaisah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua ngahnu nu’ pa in khuopi upate kung kotpi-ah ngahnu nu’ siengthona talang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngahnu nu’ pa in upate kungah, ‘Tam mipa tungah a zi dingin ka tanu ka pie a, ahi vangin a dei nawn sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tu-in ama in, ‘Na tanu ngahnu siengtho a hina lim mawngmawng ka mu sih hi,’ ci-in mawsahna thu a gen hi. Ahi vangin tamte khu ka tanu ngahnu siengtho a hina lim ahi hi,’ a ci ding hi. Tua ciengin amate in khuopi upate mai-ah tua puon a pha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuopi upate in tua mipa zawpi-in dan pie ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ngun shekel zakhat tawh ama a lieusah ding uhi. (tua khu numeino’ pa tungah a pie ding uhi.) Azieh pen ama in Israel ngahnu siengtho khat a min siesah ahi hi. Ama pen ama zi ma hi ding a, a hin sung tungtawnin tua nu khul thei nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin tami mawsahna a man hi-in, ngahnu siengtho a hina lim a kimu mawngmawng sih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />amate in a pa’ kotbieng ah tua ngahnu nu peipi-in khuopi pasalte in suong tawh seplia ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile ama in a pa’ inn sungah pahtatna tawh Israel-te lahah maizumna a tun hi. Tua bangin note sung panin sietna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasal khat, midang khat’ zi tawh a lupton laitahin a kimat leh, tua numei a luppi pa le a numei a ni gelin kithat ding hi. Tuaci’n Israel-te lah panin sietna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zi dinga kikhaamsa ngahnu siengtho khat om a, pasal khat in khuopi sungah mu-in ama a luppi leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a ni gelin tua khuopi tunkotah na zawpi ding vua, khuopi sungah tua ngahnu nu om napi kiko-in huna a nget lo zieh le, tua pasal in a vengpa’ zi a suhsiet pieh ziehin suong tawh a nipi-in na seplia ding uhi. Tuaci’n note lah panin sietna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin pasal khat in a kikhaamsa numei khat gamlahah mu-in, tua pasal pa in ama buonin a luppi leh, tua numei a luppi pa beh kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ngahnu nu bangma na law sih ding uhi; tua ngahnu nu in sina cing khielna a bawl sih hi, bangzieh ahei cile tam thu pen mi khat in a vengpa do-in a tha tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in lopang lahah tua nu a va tuo khah ziehin a kikhaamsa numei in huna ngenin kiko kha thei ding hi, ahi vangin ama hunkhie ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasal khat in a kikhaam nai lo ngahnu khat tuohin tua numei buonin luppi a, a lupton laitahun a kimat leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a luppi pa in ngahnu nu’ pa kungah ngun shekel sawmnga pie ding a, tua numei a zi hi ding hi. Azieh pen ama in tua numei a suthaang zo ta a, tuaci’n ama in a nuntah lai teng tua numei khul thei nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pasal khat in a pa’ zi tenpi lo ding a, a pa-a’ te tawh minsie lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa mite kikhopna-ah a ciltang a kisuguoi ahi sihle a pasal neitah a ki-attan poma kihal thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ mite kikhopna-ah zawlta poma kihal thei lo ding hi. Topa’ mite kikhopna-ah a suon a hlahte uh a khang sawmna dong na ngawnin kihal thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa’ mite kikhopna-ah Ammon-te ahi a, Moab-te ahi zongin kihal thei lo ding hi. Topa’ mite kikhopna-ah a suonlehlahte a khang sawmna dong nangawnin kihal thei lo ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />azieh pen Egypt panin na peikhiet lai-un amate in lampi-ah an le tui tawh ang na lamdot sih vua, ang samsie dingin Mesopotamia gama om Pethor khuo panin Beor’ tapa Balaam ciel zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(Hinanle Topa na Pasien un Balaam’ thu a mang sih hi; Topa na Pasien un note ang it ziehin, Topa na Pasien un tua samsietna pen no adingin thupha-in ang heipieh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note in na nuntah laisie-un amau’ nopsah nading le hau nading na bawlpieh ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note in Edom mite khatpo na huot bawl sih ding uhi, azieh pen amate na sanggam uh ahi hi. Egypt-te khatpo zong na huot bawl sih ding uhi, azieh pen amau’ gamah note zong pemta na hi ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa’ mite kikhopna-ah amate sung pana a pieng a khang thumna panin kihal thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na galte uh do dingin giephuol-ah na om ciengun, a kilawm lo na khat popo panin na kikem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lah vuah mi khatpo in zanlai-in bawtui a te ziehin a bua leh, giephuol panin tua pa pusuoh ding hi; giephuol sungah ama lut lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nitah ciengin tui tawh ama kipumsil ding a, ni tum ciengin giephuol sungah lut theikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Giephuol pulamah dailen nading mun khat na tuom nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na vanzahte ban vuah tuzum khat na nei ding uhi; a pulamah dai na len ciengun tua tawh lei tokuohin na zun na eh uh lei na vuakia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa na Pasien ukhu no ang hun ding le na khut sung vuah na galte ang pie dingin na giephuol utawh ang zinton ahi hi, tua ahi ziehin ama in na lah vuah a kilawm lo na khatpo a mu lo nading le ang vamangsan khah lo nadingin na giephuol uh a sientho kul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A neite kung panin no kunga ang tai silate na piekia sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na khuopite lah panun amau’ teelna mun, amau’ lungkim penna, na lah vuah note tawh ang teng ding uhi; amate na gawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Biehinnpi sungah Israel’ tanute koima numei pahtatin om thei lo ding hi; Israel tapate zong biehinnpi sungah koima khat beh a pahtatin om thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Numei pahtat nu kiguoina thaman ahi a, pasal pahtat pa kiguoina thaman ahi zongin Topa na Pasien uh’ inn sungah thuciemna khat popo-a pieh dingin na tawi sih ding uhi, azieh pen tamte khu a ni tuohin Topa na Pasien vua dingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na sanggam Israel khat tungah sum ahi a, neh ding an ahi zongin na khat popo a met deina tawh na leitawi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamdang mi khat tungah a metin leitawi na pie thei ding vua, hinanle na sanggam Israel mipa tungah a metin leitawi na pie sih ding uhi. Tam teng pen luo dinga na lut nading uh gam sungah Topa na Pasien un nasepna zosie vuah thupha ang pieh thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh tungah thuciem na na bawl ciengun, na ciemna uh na tangtun nadingun hun khinto sih un; bangzieh ahei cile Topa na Pasien un na kung vuah ang phul valon ding a, na tung vuah khielna ang hi ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin thuciemna bawl ding na kideh vua ahile na tung vuah khielna om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na kam utawh Topa na Pasien tung vuah na dei bang vua na kiciemsa ma bangun na kam sung pan vua a pusuoh poma limtahin na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na vengpa lengga lo-a na kuon uleh na du zaza uh, na kham dongun lengga na ne thei ding vua, ahi vangin na seu sung vuah bangma khat na guong sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na vengpa’ ankung ding laite lahah na pei ciengun na khut utawh a vuite na hiet thei ding vua, ahi vangin na vengpa’ ankung ding laite phieukawi tawh na at sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi khat in numei khat a zi-in a lah a, ahi vangin tua nu tungah mawsahna ding thu a mu ziehin lungkim loin ama in khulna lai giel a, tua nu’ khut sungah pie-in a inn panin tua nu peisah hi. Tua ciengin tua nu in tua pa’ inn nuasie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a nua-ah pei-in midang khat’ zi a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pasal nukhia pen in zong ama dei nawn loin khulna lai gielin a khut sungah pie a, a inn panin a peisahkia a, (ahi sihle a kitenpi a pasal nukhia pen a si hi);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a inn pana a peisah a pasal masa in tua nu a bua zaw ciengin a zi-in kilasah kia thei lo ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile tua khu Topa dinga a kidahhuoi ahi a, tuaci’n Topa na Pasien un na luo ding vua ang pieh ding leitang tungah khielna na tunpi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasal khat a zi nei cilin gal kuon lo ding a, tua tawh kipaikan nasep khatpo zong kisemsah lo ding hi. A kitenpi a zi tawh kum khat sung a inn ah lungdam tahin omton hit hiet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Koima in an gawina sum hitale, an gawina suongpeh tungnung pen hitale khapna-in la thei lo ding hi, azieh pen tua khapna ziehin nuntahna a lahpieh na suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi khat in Israel midang khat a guhdap a, sila bangin a bawl ahi a, a zua ahi zongin a kimat leh tua guta pa kithat ding hi. Tuaci’n note lah panin sietna na hemkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phah natna na vei lo nadingun kikemcing siem mama un; keima in amate ka thupieh bangin Levi siempute in ang hil bangun na gamta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt panin khuol na zin lai-un lampi-ah Topa na Pasien un Miriam tunga a bawlnate phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na vengpa kungah na khatpo na leitawi ciengun vankhap la dingin a inn ah na lut sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inn pulamah na ngah ding vua, tuaci’n leitawi na pieh pa in na kung vuah a vankhap ang peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua pa mizawng ahile vankhap dinga ang pieh puon na luppi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni tum ciengin na vengpa in tua puon tawh lumin thupha ang pieh thei nadingin vankhap ang pieh pen na piekia ding uhi; tua khu Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah note ang kipatahna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zawng le a cimaw nasema na ciel uh, adang Israel-te ahi a, na gam sung na khuopite uh khatpo sunga a teng pemtate ahi zongin a thaman uh na henpieh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nisimin a thaman uh nitum masangin na pie ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate mizawng ahi vua, a hinkhuo uh tuate tunga kinga ahi bo hi; na pieh sih uleh Topa tungah amate kiko-in ang sawm ding vua, tuaci’n na maw ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tate ziehin pate kithat lo ding a, pate ziehin zong tate kithat lo ding hi; amau’ khielna ciet zieh behin mite kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pemta khat ahi a, taga khat ahi zongin amate adingin thutang na lehei sih ding uhi; meigong nu’ puon zong vankhapin na lahpieh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Egypt gamah sila na hina ule Topa na Pasien un khum mun panin ang tatkhietna na phawh ding uhi; tua ahi ziehin tam banga na gamtat ding uh thu kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na lo vuah na an uh na lah ciengun buphaite na mangngil khah vua ahile, a lakia dingin na pei ta sih ding uhi; bangkim na sepna vuah na Topa Pasien un note thupha ang pieh thei nadingin pemtate, pa nei lote, le meigong numeite adingin tuate kinuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na olive kungte uh na sat ciengun a bate na sat sih ding uhi; tuate khu pemtate, pa nei lote, le meigong numeite ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lengga huon panun lengga na law ciengun ansangh na khonkia sih ding uhi; tuate pen pemtate, pa nei lote, le meigong numeite ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Egypt gama sila na hina uh na phawh ding uhi; tua ahi ziehin keima in tam bangin na gamtat nadingun thu kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi ni thu kitu-in zumah kiheh hinlen, a kikal vuah thukhente in thu a khenpieh a, khat pa dih tangsahin a khat pen mawsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mawpa sat thuoh dinga kilawm ahile thukhen pa in ama khuplup sah ding a, ama in a khielna dung zui-in ama mai-ah a kisat ding za satsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawmli vei kisat thei ding a, hinanle tua val hi lo ding hi; tua sanga a tamzaw a kisat leh, na muna vuah na vengpa a kineubawl a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bu a cil bawng a kam na hen sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sanggam pasalte a teng ton vua, a lah vuah khat si-in tapa a nei sih leh, a si pa’ zi pen innkuon pulama geltate khat tawh kinung thei lo ding hi. A pasal’ sanggampa in ama luppi-in a mo en ding a, ama tungah pasal sanggampa khat’ sep ding nasep sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale Israel-te lahah ama inn-gamh ahi lo nadingin tua nu tawh a nei masah a tapa pen a sisa a sanggampa’ ta-in kibawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua pa in a sanggampa’ zi ahi a mo a et nuom vawt sih leh khuopi tunkota upate kungah a sanggampa’ zi pei ding a, “Ka pasal’ sanggampa in Israel-te lahah a sanggampa’ suonlehlah kizop ding a nuom sih hi; pasal sanggampa’ nasep kei tungah sem nuom lo hi,” ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin a khuopi upate in ama hlanin hopi ding uhi. Tuale ama in, “Ama ka tenpi nuom sih hi,’ a ci teitei leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua pa kungah upate’ mitmu-in a sanggampa’ zi peito-in a kedap sutpieh ding a, a maitang cil phitin, “A sanggampa’ innkuon a zomto nuom lo mipa tam bangin kibawl taheh,” ci-in pholah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-te lahah ama’ innkuon pen, “A kedap kisutpieh pa’ innkuon,” kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mite khatlekhat a kihau a, khat pen’ zi in a kihaupi a langpa khut sung panin a pasal hunkhie dingin kisa-in, a khut tawh tua pa neitah a matpieh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua nu’ khut na sattan ding uhi; na khuotuo vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ip sung vuah tawisuong nam ni, a gol le a neu, na puoton sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na inn sung vuah a tena nam ni, a gol le a neu, na koiton sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in tawisuong a cing le a man na nei ding uhi; Topa na Pasien un ang pieh ding leitangah na hin sawt nadinguna tena a cing le a man na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen tua banga sil bawl zosie le a dih lo-a na sem zosie, Topa na Pasien uh tungah a kidahhuoi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt panin khuol na zinna vuah Amalek-te in no tunga ang bawlna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />basamin na nguoi ciengun lampi-ah note ang dona, le na nua vua ang pha zo lo zosie ang thagam piehna uh phawh un; amate in Pasien a giing sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa na Pasien un na nei ding vua gouluo-a ang piehsa leitang tung muncin tengah Topa na Pasien un na galte zosie panun tawlngahna ang pieh hun ciengin, vansin nei panin Amalek-te phawna na phietmang ding uhi; mangngil vawt sih un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na luo ding vua ang pieh ding leitangah pei-in tua leitang luo-in khum munah na ten ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un ang pieh ding leitanga pieng ga zosie panin a ga masa pawlkhat la-in law khat sungah na koi ding vua, Topa na Pasien un ama’ min om nadinga a teelna munah na pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua huna na sem siempu pa kungah pei-in ama kungah, “ Topa in ei pieh dinga ka pu ka pate uh tunga a ciemsa leitangah kang tung ta uhi, ci-in tuni-in Topa na Pasien kungah kang ko uhi,” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siempu pa in na khut sung panun law la-in Topa na Pasien uh’ maitam mai-ah tua law a koi ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ mai-ah, “Ka pu uh pen mi vahvai Aram-te ahi hi; ama Egypt-ah a peisuh a, tua muna a pem lai-in mi tawmno khat ahi bo hi. Tua munah a vanglien, a thahat, le minam tampi ang hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Egypt-te in ei bawlsia-in na hamsa pipi ei semsahin ei gimsah vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaci’n kote zong ka pu ka pate uh’ Pasien Topa tungah ka kiko vua, Topa in ka aw uh ei za-in ama in ka thuohna uh, ka gimna uh, le ka gentheinate uh ei mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in a thahat a khut, a kizah a banhat, a zauhuoi a vanglietna, lim le na lamdangte lahna tawh Egypt panin ei na peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in tami munah ei na tunpi-in, bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna tami leitang ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa aw, nang in ko nei pieh leitanga a pieng gamasa pen tu-in kang peipi uhi,” na ci ding uhi. Topa na Pasien uh’ mai-ah tuate na koi ding vua, Topa na Pasien uh’ mai-ah na kun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa na Pasien un noma le na innkuonpite tunga ang pieh na hoi zosie ziehin, noma le Levi-te le note lahah a teng pemtate tawh na lungdamton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sawm-ah-khat pieh kum ahi a kum thumna kumin na hlawsa uh panin sawm-ah-khat zosie na pieh zaw ciengun, (tua khu sawm-ah-khat pieh kum ahi hi) amate in na khuopite sung vuah an ne-in a gilva thei nadingun Levi-te, pemtate, tagate, le meigong numeite tunga na pieh uh na hlawsa uh sawm-ah-khat na pieh zaw ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah tam bangin na gen ding uhi: “Ka inn sung panin a siengtho tanh teng ka tuomkoi zo a, kei nei sawlna bangin na thupiehna zosie dung zui-in Levi-te, pemtate, tagate, le meigong numeite tungah ka pie zo hi; keima in na thupiehnate palsat loin ka mangngil sih hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka da ka kaa sungin zong sawm-ah-khat ka ne sih hi; ka bua sungin zong tuate la loin misite tungah tuate ka pie sih hi. Topa ka Pasien’ thu ka mang zo a, kei nei thupieh bang lienin ka sem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A siengtho nangma tenna vantung panin ei ensuh inlen, ka pu ka pate uh tungah bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna gam na ciemsa bangin, na mi Israel-te nei piehsa leitang thupha ei pie in,” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuni mama-in na tung vuah Topa na Pasien un na zui ding uh tami thukhamte le ngaina kipte ang pie hi; tuaci’n na lungsim zosie ule na hinna zosie utawh tuate limtahin na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuni-in na Pasien uh ahi dingin Topa’ thukimna na nga zo ta uhi: tuale a lampite zui a, a thukhamte, a thupiehte, le a ngaina kipte kemcingin ama’ thu na man ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni-in Topa in na tung vua ang ciemsa bangin ama in ama’ nei ding mi le ama’ thukhamte a zui dingin na thukimna uh a nga zo ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama in a bawlsa minam zosiete tungah a kiphatzaw, a minthangzaw, le a kipatawizaw-in ang koi ding hi; tuale ama’ ang ciemsa bangin Topa na Pasien uh adingin a siengtho mi na suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses le Israel upate in tam bangin mi zosie thu vaihlah uhi: Tuni-a kang gen uh thupiehna zosie zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un ang pieh ding leitanga pei dingin Jordan na galkai ni-un, suongtum golte na phut ding vua, a zutna tawh a tung na zutmam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh’ Pasien Topa in ang ciem bangin Topa na Pasien un ang pieh ding bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna leitang lut dingin na galkai ciengun, tua suongte tungah tam thukham sunga a om thu zosie a unpi-in na giel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jordan na galkai zaw ciengun Ebal muol tungah tam suongte na phut ding vua, tuni-a kang thupiehte tawh kizui-in tam suongte phutin a zutna tawh a tung na zutmam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khum munah Topa na Pasien uh adingin maitam khat na lam ding vua, suongte tawh maitam bawlin tuate tungah sia vanzahte na zang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kisui lo suongtumte tawh Topa na Pasien uh’ maitam na bawl ding uhi. Tua ciengin tua maitam tungah Topa na Pasien uh adingin meihal biehnate pie unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />khumi munah thunuom biehpiehnate ne-in, Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah nuomsa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua suongte tungah tam thu zosie kicien tahin na giel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses le Levi siempute in Israel-te zosie hopi-in tam bangin a gen uhi: Israel-te aw, sip dide unlen ngai un! Tuni mama-in Topa na Pasien uh’ mite na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa na Pasien uh’ thu mangin tuni-a kang gen ama’ thupiehnate le ama’ thukhamte na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum ni ma-in Moses in mite tam bangin thuhil hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jordan na galkai zaw ciengun mite thupha a pie dingin Gerazim muolah tam teng ding ding uhi: Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Joseph, le Benjamin-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale Ebal muol tungah mi samsie dingin tam teng ding ding uhi: Reuben, Gad, Asher, Zebulun, Dan, le Naphtali-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te zosie tungah Levi-te in awging lienpi tawh tam bangci ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Topa adingin a kidahhuoi khut siempa’ khut tawh a kibawl, a kikheng ahi a, a kisung ahi zongin milim bawlin a biedap poma samsietin om taheh,” a ci ding vua, tuale mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci-in a dawngkia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“A nu ahi a, a pa a hi zongin a zatah lo poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A vengpa’ kigisuong a khin poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen! “ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mittawpa lam a puikhiel poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Pemta, taga le meigong numeite tungah thutang a leheipieh poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A pa’ zi niih lempieh a, a pa’ zi tawh a lumton poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ganhing khat popo tawh a lumton mi poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“A nu’ tanu, a pa’ tanu, ahi sihle a sanggamnu tawh a lumton poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“A sungnu tawh a lumton poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“A vengpa a thatdap poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mawna nei lopa tha nadinga guhgol a la poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tam thukham sunga om thu zosie zui loin a tukip lo poma samsietin om taheh,” ci ding uhi. Mi zosie in, “Amen!” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ thu na man vua, keima in tuni-a na tung vua kang gen ama’ thupiehte zosie limtaha na zui uleh, Topa na Pasien un leitunga minam zosiete tungah ang koi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ thu na man uleh na tung vuah tam thuphate zosie ang tung ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuopi sungah thupha na nga ding vua, khuotate-ah zong thupha na nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na sung pan vua a piengte, na leitang pan vua a pieng gate, na ganhonte, na bawnghonte ule na tuuhonte uh pungin thupha na nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lawte ule na annel pawina kuongte vuah thupha om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na sungtum uh ciengin thupha na nga ding vua, na pusuo ciengun zong thupha na nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in na mai vuah ang langpang na galte a lelsah ding hi; note ang langpang dingin lampi khat panin ang kuon ding vua, lampi sagi-in na mai vuah a taimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ansalte ule na sepna zosie vuah Topa in thupha ang tungsah ding hi; Topa na Pasien un note ang pieh ding leitangah ama in thupha ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ thupiehte zui-in ama’ lampi na tot nah uleh na tung vua ang ciemsa bangin a mi siengtho dingin Topa in note ang sukip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leitung mi zosiete in Topa mina ang kihlat lam a thei ding vua, ang giing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in na pu na pate uh tungah pieh dinga a na ciemsa leitangah noma sung pana a piengte, na ganhon pan vua a piengte le na leitang pan vua a piengte tungah Topa in note nahpitahin ang hausah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na leitang tung vuah a hunin guo a zusah ding le na sepna zosie vuah thupha ang pie dingin Topa in vantung le a gou hoi kholna inn ang honpieh ding hi. Minam tampite na leitawisah ding vua, hizongle note in mi kungah na leitawi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kung vuah tuni-a keima in kang gen Topa na Pasien uh’ thupiehte mangin tuate limtahin na zui vua, tuni-in na kung vua kang gen kammalte panin amau’ nasem dingin pasien dangte zui-in zietlam ahi a, vei lam ahi zongin na piel sih nah po uleh, Topa in a mei lamin ang bawl sih dinga, a lutang lamin ang bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle Topa na Pasien uh’ thu na man sih vua, tuni-a kang gen ahi ama’ thupiehte le a thukham teng zosie limtaha na zui sih uleh, tam samsietna zosie in note ang pha dinga, na tung vuah ang tu ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuopi sungah ang kisamsie ding a, khuota-ah zong ang kisamsie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lawte ule na annel pawina kuongte kisamsie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na sung vua a piengte, na leitang pan vua a pieng gate, na bawngte ule na tuuhonte uh zong kisamsie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na sungtum ciengun ang kisamsie ding a, na pusuo ciengun zong ang kisamsie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima ei nuasie-in na gamtatsietnate uh ziehin ang kinaw suhsiet masangun Topa in na tung vuah gimna, patauna, galgihnate ang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in na luo ding vua na lut nading uh leitang panin ang suhmang masangin natna in ang bawmsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in kumzawnna, cithuo natna, cipawm natna, a sa mama khuolumna le guotui kanna, huisa mutgawpna, le maaibuoh natnate tawh ang gimsah ding a, tuaci’n na sigam masangsie-un ang del ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lutung vua om vantung zong sumngo bangin sanin guo zu lo ding hi; na nei vua om leitung zong siatang bangin sah giagua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in na gam sung vua guote leivui ang suohsah ding a, ang kisuhsiet masangsie-un van panin na tung vuah tuate ang kiesuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in na galte uh mai-ah ang guolelsah ding hi; amate a do dingin lam khatin na kuonton ding vua, a masang vuah lam sagi-in na taimang ding uhi. Leitung kumpi gamte zosie adingin cimulthaw huoi na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na luonghawmte uh vana leng vate le leitunga om ganhing zosie’ an hi ding a, tuate delmang ding mi koima om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in na damkia thei lo nadingun Egypt uilutte le hima naikulte, hima lipneite le cithahte tawh note ang gimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in motna, mittawtna, le lungsim buoina tawh note ang gimsah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />miel lahah mittawte a kimaimaw bangin suntanglai pi-in na kimaimaw ding vua, ahi vangin na lampi uh na mu thei sih ding uhi; mite’ bawlsiet le bulu-in na om zing ding vua, ang panpi ding koima a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zi dingin numei khat na khaam ding vua, ahi vangin midang khat in ama a na luppi ding hi. Inn na lam ding vua, a sungah na teng sih ding uhi. Lengga um na bawl ding vua, a ga na nekha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na mitmu-un na bawngtangte uh kigo ding a, a sa na nekha sih ding uhi. Na maitang vuah na laate uh ang kiguhpieh ding a, na kung vuah ang kipiekia nawn sih ding hi. Na tuute uh na galte kipie ding a, ang hu ding koima om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na tapate ule na tanute uh midangte kipie ding a, sun nitang tumin amate na en ngetngut ding uhi; na et na lamun na mit uh a kham ding a, hizongle amate bangma na law zo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na thei ngai lo uh minam khat in na leitang pan vua a piengte le na sepsa zosie uh ne sieng ding hi; ang kibawlsie-in ang kigawt zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na mit vua na mu ding uh nate ziehin na motlaw va-ia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in na damkia thei lo nading uh a nasie mama uilut natna tawh na khup ule na keng ban vuah, na ketawte panun na luvum dongun ang genthei bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Noma le na pu na pate un a thei ngai nai lo minam khat kungah Topa in noma le na tung vuah vaihawm dinga na koi uh na kumpipa uh ang peipi ding a, khum sungah singlesuong tawh kibawl pasien dangte’ na na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa in ang peipina mi zosiete lahah a cizathuoi, paunah le thugentena na suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lo-ah khaici na tu ding vua, hinanle themno khat beh na la bo ding uhi, azieh pen kauphe in a netum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lengga um bawlin na pawngil sipsep ding vua, hizongle lenggazu dawn loin a ga zong na lo sih ding uhi, azieh pen na lengga uh lung neh ding ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na gam sung zosie vuah olive kung na nei ding vua, hinanle a thau na kinu tuom sih ding uhi. Azieh pen na olive gate uh pulmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tanu le tapate na nei ding vua, hinanle noma-a’ hi den lo ding hi, bang ding ahei cile amate salin kiman ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na singkungte ule na leitang pan vua a pieng ga zosie khuombai an ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Note sangin na lah vua om pemtate a sangzaw semsem ding vua, note na niem suhsuh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amate in note ang leitawi ding vua, hizongle note in amate leitawi na pie zo sih ding uhi; amate a lutang suoh ding a, note a meidawn na suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama in na kung vua ang gen thupiehte le thukhamte zui loin, Topa na Pasien uh’ thu mang lo na hi ziehun ang kisuhsiet masangsie-un na tung vuah tam samsietna zosie ang tung ding a, note hing nuadelin ang nua phah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuate pen noma le na suonlehlahte lahah lim le hilkholna lim hi zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Sil bang kimah kiningcinga note na op lai-un lungdam kipah tahin Topa na Pasien uh’ na sem lo na hi ziehun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Topa in note do dinga ang sawl ding na galte uh’ na, gilkiel dangtana, guohtanga opna, bangkim tasapna tawh na sem ding uhi. Note ang suhsiet masangsie-in na ngawng vuah sia hahkol ang bul ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Topa in a gamlapi, leimong pan muvanlai bangin note ang taw dingin a ham na thei lo uh minam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />a giinhuoi minam, khanghamte a zatah vawt lo le khangnote zong maipha a pie tuon lo minam khat na kung vuah ang sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Note na sigam masangsie-un na gannote ule na leitang pieng a gate hing nehtum piehin ang suhsiet masangsie-un an, lenggazu, sathau, na ganhonte uh ahi sihle na tuuhon note uzong ang henpieh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Note in na muon uh kul muonhuoi a sangpite a cipzan masangin amate in na gam sung zosie vua a om na khuopi zosie ang imtawm ding uhi; Topa na Pasien un note ang pieh na gam sung zosie vua a om na khuopi zosie sung vuah ang imtawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Na galte un na khuopi zosie uh imtawm ding a, na cimaw hun sungun Topa na Pasien un ang pieh, na sung pan vua a pieng na tanute ule na tapate uh’ sa na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Note lahah mi pien hoi le a kimipisah penpen pa in zong a sanggam, a kawilai a it a zi, a si nukhia pen a tate nangawn zong an a pie nuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Na khuopite sung vuah ang ki-imtawm nading u le na galte un ang lungkhamsah nading uh hun sungah neh kitasam ding ahi ziehin ama in a neh a tate’ sa koima a hawm nuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Note lahah a ngehsuo, a cithei pen numei, ama ngehsuo-in a ci a sa a nel seng ziehin a ketaw tawh tuol a tuon nuom va-ia lo nu in zong a it a kawilai a pasal, a tanute le a tapate adingin a sunga pieng naungehte le a kalkawm pana a peikhie a naulapte nangawn a phal sih ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile a khuopite sung vuah ang ki-imtawmna le na galte un ang lungkhamsah nading hun sungah neh kitasam seng ding ahi ziehin ama in a tate a nedap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tam laibu sunga kigiel tami thukham kammalte limtahin na zui sih vua, a vanglien, a cizathuoi min, Topa na Pasien na zatah sih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Topa in noma le na suonlehlahte tungah a nasie le a dam thei lo gimnate le a zauhuoi natsaute tawh ang nuoicip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ama in na giin uh Egypt natnate ang tungsahkia ding a, tuate in na tung vuah ang bawmden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Note ang kisuhsiet masangsie, tam thukham laibu sungah kiciemte sih nanle natna dang le gimna zosie zong Topa in na tung vuah ang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Hun khat lai-in vana aasi za pha nan locin themno khat na hi ta ding uhi. Azieh pen Topa na Pasien uh’ thu na mang nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ang hausah cieng ule ang punsah ciengun Topa a lungkim bang lien ma-in, ang sietsah ding cieng ule ang manthaisah ding ciengun zong Topa lungkim veve ding hi; na luo ding uh gam na lut vua kipanin ang kiphungkal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Topa in leimong khat pan mong khat, minam zosie lahah ang thethang ding hi; noma le na pu na pate un zong a thei ngai nai lo uh singlesuong tawh kibawl pasien dangte’ na na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tua minamte lahah lungnopna na mu sih ding vua, na ketaw uh a tatna khop ding tawlngahna mun zong na mu sih ding uhi. Khum munah Topa in lungsim patauna, mitgimna, lungsim zawngkhalnate ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na hinkhuo uh lunghimawna tawh na om zing ding uhi; sun le zanin zau denin lungmuonna hinkhuo na nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Na lungsim un a giin zauna le na mit un a mu ding nate’ ziehin zingmawngin, “Nitah hi leh!” na ci ding vua, nitahin zong, “Zingmawng hi leh!’” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Na mukia nawn sih ding uhi, ci-a kang kamciemsa lampi ahi Egypt gamah Topa in tembaw tawh ang peipikia ding hi; tua sunga na galte kung vuah sila numei le sila pasal dingin na kizua ding vua, ahi vangin koima in ang lei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Topa in amate tawh Horeb ah a na bawlsa a thuciemna banah Israel-te tawh Moab ah thuciemna a bawl nadinga Moses a thupieh thuciemna kammalte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te zosie hlanin a kung vuah tam bangin a gen hi: Topa in Egypt gam sungah na mitmu-un Pharaoh tung, a silate zosie tung le a gam sung zosiete tungah a bawlna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />na mit un a musa ze-etna lienpite, limte le na lamdang thupi zosiete na thei zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuni dongin Topa in na tung vuah thu na tel nading uh lungsim ahi a, na mu thei nading uh mit ahi a, na zah thei nading uh bil ahi zongin ang pie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in senel gam sungah kum sawmli sung kang pui zo ta hi. Na el vua na puonte uh sie loin na kedapte uzong a sie sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh ka hi lam nei thei nadingun neh ding anlum le dawn ding lenggazu ahi a, khamthei zu ahi zongin na ne sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami munah nang pei ciengun ei do dingin Heshbon kumpipa Sihon le Bashan kumpipa Og ang pei uhi, ahi vangin amate i zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau’ leitang i la vua, Reuben-te, Gad-te le Manasseh minam alangte tungah luo dingin i pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na sepna uh bangkim ah na lamzan thei nadingun tami thuciemna kammalte limtahin zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un tuni-a note tawh a bawl ahi Topa na Pasien uh’ thuciemna sungah na lut thei nadingun, tuni-in ama in ama’ mi dinga ang kipsah thei nading, le na tung vuah ang ciemna le na pu na pate uh Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tungah a kiciemna bangin na Pasien uh ahi thei nadingin na minam lutangte uh, na upate uh, na uliente uh, Israel pasal zosie, na tate uh, na zite uh, na giephuol sung vua om pemtate, na sing uh ang tompieh, na tui uh ang tawipiehte a kipan note zosie tuni-in Topa na Pasien uh’ mai-ah na ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kiciemin ka bawl tam thuciemna pen tuni-in i Topa Pasien mai-a a ding note beh tawh ka bawl ahi sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuni-a note tawh ang omton lo mite tawh zong a bawlton ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Egypt gama i ten dan i giedan ule i nawhkhah uh minamte laikima i pei dan uh zong na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amau’ sil kidahhuoi, singlesuong tawh a kibawl, ngun le kham tawh a kibawl, a lah vua a om milimte na mu zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note lahah numei ahi a, pasal ahi a, innkuon ahi a, minam khat ahi zongin tua minamte’ pasien-te bie dingin Topa i Pasien kung panin a lungsim kihei om kha thei ding hi. Note lahah a gunei singhui khat huihla-in a ga khalawng khat ang ga kha thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tami kiciemna kammal a za zosie in a lungsim vuah amau le amau thupha kipie tawmin, “Lungkhautahin ka gamtat vangin ka suohta veve ding hi,” a ci mi ang om kha ding hi. (Tua ahi ciengin mihoi le misie, a kibangin gimna a tungsah ding hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau’ langkhatah meikhu bangin Topa’ lungthahna le thangsietna kitungto ding ahi ziehin Topa in amate a maisah nuom sih ding hi. Tami laibu sunga a kigiel samsietna zosie amate tungah tung ding a, Topa in mun vannuoi panin amau’ min phiet maimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam thukham laibu sunga kigiel samsietna thuciemte tawh kituohin tuosietna thuoh dingin Topa in Israel minam zosie lah panin amate a tuomin a la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mai lamah ang khang ding na tate ule gamlapi pana ang pei gamdang mite in tua gam kisietna le Topa in a tunsah gimnate a mu ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a leitang zosie uh kaat le ci tawh a katum, khaici kivaw lo, bangma a po lo, lopa zong a po zo lona mun, a sinso zieha Topa in a suhsiet Sodom le Gomorrah, Admah le Zeboiim-te’ kisietna tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate le leitung minam zosie in lamdang a sa ding vua, “Bang zieha Topa in tami gam ahi ci bawl va-ia adiei? Tam lungthahna lienpi a piengsah khu bang ahi ta diei?” a ci tahtah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mite in, “Tam pen Egypt pana amate a peipi lai-in amate tawh a bawl, a pu a pate’ Pasien ahi, Topa’ thuciemna amate in nuasie-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a thei ngai lo uh pasien dangte le ama in amate tunga a pieh lo pasien dangte langah a kihei vua, tuate’ na semin a bieh zieh uh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tuaci’n khum gamah Topa’ lungthahna a tung a, tam laibu sunga kigiel samsietna zosie tua leitangah a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in sinsona, lungham thangpaina tawh a leitang panun a notmang a, tuni-a i mu bangun gam dangah amate a notmang hi,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thusimte Topa i Pasien-a’ ahi a, ahi vangin ang kilah thute ahile eite le i tate-a’ hi-in, tam thukham sunga thu zosie i zui zing ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na mai vua ka koi tami thuphate le samsietna zosiete na tung vuah ang tun ciengin, Topa na Pasien un ang nawkhietna minam zosiete lahah tam thute phawhkia-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuni-a note kang thupieh bangin Topa na Pasien uh kungah noma le na suon na hlahte na kilekia vua, na lungsim zosie ule na hinna zosie utawh ama’ thute na man uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un hing nuomsa sah kia-in na tung vuah lainatna ang nei ding a, ang thethangna mi zosie lah panin Topa na Pasien un ang kaikhawmkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leimong khat nangawnah nang kinawdawh nan ule Topa na Pasien un tua mun panin ang khawm ding a, ang peipikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na pu na pate uh’ neisa gamah hing peipi-in tua gam na luo ding uhi; ama in na pu na pate uh sanga a citheizaw le a pungzaw-in note ang siem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua banah na lungsim zosie ule na hinna zosie utawh Topa na Pasien uh itin na hin thei nadingun, Topa na Pasien un noma le na suon na hlahte’ lungsim tep ang tanpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un ang bawlsie na galte ule na langte tungah tami samsietna zosie ang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ thu na mangkia ding vua, tuni-a kang gen ama’ thupiehte zosie na zui ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale Topa na Pasien un na sepnate zosie vuah, na sung pan vua piengte, na ganhonte sung pana piengte, na leitang pan vua piengte zosie-ah na dau uh ang peisah ding hi. Bang ding ahei cile na pu na pate uh tungah ama a lungkim bangin note tungah zong Topa ang lungkimkia ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale na lungsim zosie ule na hinna zosie utawh Topa lamah na kihei ziehun tami thukham laibu sunga a kigiel ama’ thupiehte le ama’ thukhamte zuina tawh Topa na Pasien uh’ thu na man uleh ama in ang daupeisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tahtahin tuni-a kang gen tami thupieh pen note adingin a hamsa seng sih a, zuila ding zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“I zah thei nading ule i zui thei nadingun vantungah koi va kato-in ei va lahpieh ta ding ahei?” na ci thei nadingun vantunga om ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tua thu za-in i zui thei nadingun koi in tuipi galkhat kantanin ei lahpieh ding ahei?” na ci thei nadingun zong tuipi gala om ahi kan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Om lo hi, a thu na kung mama vuah a om hi; a thu na zui thei nadingun na kam sung ule na lungsim sung vuah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />En un, tuni-in na mai vuah hinna le nopsahna, sina le sietna ka koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh itna, ama’ lampite totna, ama’ thupiehte, a thukhamte le a ngaina kipte zuina tawh, tuni-in na kung vua kang gen Topa na Pasien uh’ thupiehnate na man uleh, note nungta-in pungin gou luo dinga na lut nading uh gam sungah Topa na Pasien un thupha ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin na lungsim uh kihei-in a thugen za loin pasien dangte mai-a a kun ding le a na a sem dinga na lampiel uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />keima in tuni-in note kungah kang gen hi, note na mangthai ding uhi; Jordan galkai-in a lut ding le a nei dinga na peina uh gam sungah sauvei teng loin na mangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in tuni-in na langkhat vuah teci a pang dingin vanpi le leipi ka ko a, na mai vuah hinna le sina, thuphate le samsietnate ka koi zo hi. Noma le na suon na hlahte uh a hin thei nadingin nuntahna teel unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh itin a thu mangin, ama tukip un; azieh pen Topa in na pu na pate uh Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tungah a pieh dinga a ciemsa gamah na ten thei nadingun note adingin tua khu nuntahna le khansauna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te zosie kungah tam thute a unpi-a a gen zaw ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama in a kung vuah, “Tu-in kei kum za le kum sawmni ka pha ta hi. Dei bangin ka pia zo nawn sih a, Topa in ka kungah, ‘Tami Jordan gal na kai sih ding hi,’ ei ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa na Pasien mama uh na mai vuah ang galkai ding hi. Ama in na mai vuah tam minamte susie ding a, amate na suonmang ding uhi. Topa’ kamciemsa bangin na mai vuah Joshua a galkai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Amor-te’ kumpi Sihon le Og tung le a gam uh tunga a bawl bangin amate tungah zong a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in na tung vuah amate ang pie ding a, na kung vua kang thupieh zosie tawh a kituohin amate tungah na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thahat unlen hangsan un; zau sih unlen amate giing sih un. Azieh pen no ang zawpi pa khu Topa na Pasien uh ahi hi; ama in note ang cimaw sah sih ding a, zong ang nuasie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Joshua hlanin Israel-te zosie’ mitmu-in ama kungah tam bangin a gen hi: “Thahat inlen hangsan in, bangzieh ahei cile Topa in a pu a pate uh tungah pieh dinga a ciemsa gamah tam mite zawpi ding khu nangma na hi hi; nangma in amate khum gam na luosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na masanga a peipa khu Topa ahi hi. Nangma tawh ama ang om ding hi; ama in nang hing cimawsah loin, zong hing nuasie lo ding hi. Zau sinlen lungkie sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in tam thukham giel a, tuaci’n Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo Levi’ tapa siempute le Israel upa zosie tungah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses in tam bangin amate thu a pie hi: “A kisesa leiba kimaisah kum ahi kum sagi a cin siel, buh pawi hunin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama’ teel nading mun Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah a kilaa dingin Israel-te zosie ang pei ciengun, amau’ zahin Israel-te zosie mai-ah tam thukham na sim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in za-in Topa na Pasien uh zatah a, tami thukham sunga kammal zosie limtahin a zui thei nadingun nupi, papi, naupangte le na khuo sung vua a teng pemtate khawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n tami thukham a thei nai lo a tate un zong za-in, Jordan galkai-in na nei ding uh gama na ten laisie uh na Topa na Pasien uh zatah dan ding ang thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Na si ding hun ang nai ta hi; ama ka sawl thei nadingin Joshua hing hlan inlen, kikhopna puonbuh sungah nangma zong hing om in,” ci hi. Tuaci’n Moses le Joshua pei-in kikhopna puonbuh sungah a om vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />puonbuh kotpi gei meii khuomah Topa kilang hi; puonbuh kotah meii khuom a kitung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Na pu na pate tawh a lumton bai ding na hi ta hi. Tua ciengin a pei nading uh gam sunga gamdang pasien-te tawh tam mite a pahtat ding uhi; amate in kei ei nuasie-in amate tawh ka bawlsa ka thuciemte a palsat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin a tung vuah ka sin a so ding hi. Keima in amate nuasie-in ka mai ka phuol ding hi; amate olno tahin nehtumin a om ding vua, amate tungah a zauhuoi gimna tampi a tung ding hi. Khum ni ciengin, ‘Eite lahah i Pasien ang op lo ziehin tami gimnate i tunga ang tung hi lo amah?’ a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin pasien dangte lamah a kihei ziehun a gamtatnasa uh gitlona zosie ziehin ka mai ka phuol tahtah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in tami la giel inlen, Israel-te tungah hil in; Israel-te langkhatah kei dinga teci a suoh dingin a kam sung vuah tami la mop in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen a pu a pate uh kungah kiciemin ka khapsa bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna gamah amate tunpi siengin, tuaci’n amate in an khamtahin ne-in a thau milmel zaw ciengun, pasien dangte lamah kihei-in a na uh semin kei ei simmaw ding vua, ka thuciemna zong a susie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tung vuah a zauhuoi gimna tampi a tun ciengin a langkhat vuah tami la teci-in a pang ding hi, azieh pen a suonlehlate’ kam sung panin tami la mangngil thei loin a om ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile keima in amate pieh dinga ka ciemsa gamah ka tut masang, tu nangawnin zong bang bawl nuom uh ci ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ni ma-in Moses in tami la gielin Israel-te a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Nun’ tapa Joshua sawl a, “Thahat inlen hangsan in, bangzieh ahei cile amate pieh dinga ka ciemsa leitang tungah Israel-te na peipi ding hi; nangma tawh kang om ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses in a tawp dongin laibu khat sungah tami thukham kammalte a giel zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses in Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo Levi-te thu pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tami thukham laibu la unlen Topa na Pasien uh’ thuciemna singkuong gei-ah koi un; na langkhat vuah teci dingin khum munah omsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile bangza taha a ledo mi le a lungkhauh mi na hi uh ahei ci kang thei hi. Ka hin sung bawna na lah vuah Topa ledo na hi uleh ka si nua ciengin bang zatahin na ledo kan zaw lai ding vuoi izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami kammalte amau’ zahin genin, a langkhat vuah teci-a pang dingin vanpi le leipi ka ko thei nadingin keima kungah na minam upate ule na ulien zosie uh hing khawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Azieh pen ka si nua ciengin nang siet gamtat valon ding vua, kang thupieh lampi panin na piel ding lam uh ka thei hi. Mailam hun ciengin Topa muna-ah siet gamtatin na khut utawh na bawlsate uh ziehin ama lungthahsah ding na hi ziehun na tung vuah gimna ang tung ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in a kikhawm Israel mi buppi’ zahin tami la guite a dawng tawp dongin a sut hi:
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vantungte aw, na ngai un, kang hopi ding uhi; ka kam pana ka thugente leitung in za taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Guomal bangin ka thuhilte phi-in, daicim bangin ka thugente kie hinlen; lo dawng tunga guophi le ankung tunga guozu bang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ min ka tangko ding hi; eite’ Pasien tungah vanglietna pie un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama suongpi hi a, a nasepte bukimin a lampite zosie khu dihtatna ahi hi. A zuou lo thuman Pasien ahi a, midih le mi thutang ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hinanle a letat a tate in ama tungah gamtat sie-in, amate pen a lampiel le a lungkawi khang mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mimaw, mingolte aw, tam bangin Topa thuh ding na hi uh amah? Note ang piengsah, ang siem, ang kipsah na pa uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hun luite phawh unlen, muol ei khupsan hunte lungngai un; na pa dong un, ama in ang theisah ding hi; na upate dong locin ang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sangpen Pa in minamte gou pie a, mihing ten nading mun a se ciengin, pasien-te a phaza zui-in mite’ gamgi a phut hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa’ tanh khu ama’ mite ahi a, Jacob khu ama kipie a tanh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in senel gamgawta munah ama a va hi. Ama in ama dalin khoi a, a mittang a diem bangin amate diemin a kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A bu tawhnawi-in a note tungah a hla a zap, a hla zahin a note a man, a hlakui tawh a note a puo muvanlai bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa beh in ama a pui a; ama tawh gamdang pasien omton lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in leitung a sangna-ah amate tengsah a, lo-a piengte tawh a va hi; suong kawm panin khuoizu tawh ama va a, meituh suong panin sathau a nesah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />bawnghon panin bawng thaukhal, tuuhon panin tuunawi, tuunote le tuutangte’ thau tawh; Bashan bawnghonte le keelte, mangbu hoi pente tawh lengga panin lenggatui san na dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jacob in khamtahin a ne hi; Jeshurun ang thau-in a keng tawh ei lepeh ta hi. Na thau ziehun na sa uh dim phitphet a, na zol sipsep uhi! Ama in ama a bawl pa Pasien nuasie a, a kihutdamna Suongpi a simmaw bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate pen pasien dangte tawh a hazat thei nadingin a gamta vua, a kidahhuoi nate tawh ama a lungthahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien ahi lo dawite, a thei khah ngai lo uh pasien-te, na pu na pate un a giin lo uh, tu nai-a ang tung tha ahi, pasien-te kung po-ah biehpiehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note in ang hing pa Suongpi na phawhkha ta sih vua, ang siem pa Pasien na mangngil ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in mu-in haza a, ama in a tanute le a tapate a nol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in: Keima in a kung panun ka mai ka phuol ding a, a tawpna-ah amate bang ang suoh vuoi ka en ding h; bangzieh ahei cile amate pen a letat khang mite ahi vua, muon tah lo tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasien a hi lote tawh ka hazat nadingin ei bawl vua, a milimte utawh ei lungthahsah uhi. Tua ahi ciengin keima in mihinga sim tah lo mite tawh a hazat thei nadingun amate ka bawl ding a, a maw mama minam khat tawh ka thangpaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bang zieh ahei cile ka lungthahna mei bangin kuong a, Misikhuo dongah a kuong hi; tua in leitung le a tunga piengte a valtum a, muol le tang bulpite a kuongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tung vuah gimna ka khol ding a, a langkhat vuah ka thaltangte ka zang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate gilkielin a sigam ding vua, a sa mama meikuong le a siehuoi natna in amate valtum ding hi. A pet dingin a ha hiem gamsate, a tu dingin gu a nei gulte ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gawldung lahah namsau in amate thatgam ding a, tuaci’n innkhan sungah zauna lienpi om ding hi. Azieh pen tangval le ngahnu, nawi tep nausente, samkangte tawh a that ton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate thethangin mihing lah panin a kiphaw khahna uh phiet ding ka ngaisun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ahi vangin alangte in a ngaisun khiel vua, “Ka khut un guol a zo hi. Tam teng zosie a sem khu Topa ahi sih hi,” hing ci kha ding ahi ziehun galte in ei phin ding ka zau hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngaisutna nei lo minam ahi uhi; a sung vuah theitelna om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mipil hi pawse uleh, tam thute a thei ding uhi; a tawpna-ah bang pieng ding ci a khinkhai thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A Suongpi un amate zua sih hinlen, Topa in amate piekhie sih leh, bangci-in mi khat in mi tulkhat gamdelin, mi ni in mi tul sawm taisah zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eite’ Suongpi le amau’ suongpi kibang lo hi; i galte mimaw ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A lenggui uh Sodom lenggui ahi a, Gommorah lengga um pana ang kipan ahi hi; a lengga uzong a gunei lengga ahi a, a bawhte zong a kha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lenggazu uh gulpi gu le muoltan gupha tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tami khu ka kungah kikhol a, ka gou kholna sunga kikoi hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Phulahna le thuhkiana khu kei-a’ hi a, a hun ciengin amate a keng uh a taal ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile a tuosiet hun ding uh nai mama ta a, a siet nading uh mallangtahin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A vang bei lam ule sila le a suohta koima a op lo lam uh a mu ciengin, Topa in ama’ mite dih a tangsah ding a, ama’ nasemte tungah lainatna a nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tam bangin ci ding hi: A kibuhna uh suongpi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a biehpiehna uh sathau ne-in, dawn thei a biehna uh a dawn amau’ pasien-te hei-ah om uh ahei? Tuate thosahin kihusah unlen, na kidalna hisah un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tu-in thei un; kei, keima nangawn ama ka hi hi. Kei simlo pasien dang koima a om sih hi. Ka that a, ka hingsah hi; ka liemsah a, ka damsah hi; ka khut sung panin a hunkhie zo koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile vantung lamah khut lamto-in tam bangin ka kiciem hi: Keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />a te lihleh ka namsau tatin, thukhen dingin tua ka mat ciengin; ka galte tungah phu ka la ding a, ei mudate ka thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka thaltangte si ka khamsah ding a, ka namsau in satah a nawmval ding hi. Tuate pen a samsau galte, a kithat mite le a kiman mite’ sisan pan hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Vante, ama’ mite aw, phat unlen, no pasien zosiete aw, ama bie un! Bangzieh ahei cile a ma in a tate’ sisan phu la dinghi; ama in a langte tungah phu a la ding hi. Ama a mudate thuhkia ding a, ama’ mite adingin tua gam a siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Moses pei a, mite’ zahin ama le Nun’ tapa Joshua in tam lamalte zosie a sut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Moses in tam lamal zosie a sut zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />ama in a kung vuah tam bangin a gen hi: Tuni-a na kung vuah teci panga kang gen tami thute zosie ciemte un; na tate un tami thukham kammalte limtahin a zui thei nadingun thupieh bangin gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tami pen note dingin thu mawhna ahi sih a, na hinna uh ahi a, luo dinga Jordan gal na kaina uh gam sungah ahi zongin tami thu ziehin sawt veipi na nungta ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Khum ni mama-in Topa in Moses tungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Jericho gal lam, Moab gam sunga Nebo Muol le Abarim muolvum ah kato unlen, Israel-te’ tan dinga ka pieh Canaan gam va gal-et ta un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hor Muol tungah na sanggampa Aaron si-in a mite tawh a kigawm bangin, nang zong na katona muolvumah na si ding a, na mite tawh na kigawm ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile Zin gam, Kadesh khuo gei-a Meribah tui phuol, Israel-te lahah nei upna na hlasuo ta a, Israel-te lahah ka siengthona na kemcing ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A gamlapi panin khumi gam na gal-et bep ding a, ahi vangin Israel-te tunga ka pieh gam sungah na lut sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam pen Pasien’ mi ahi Moses in a si masanga Israel-te thupha a piehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in: Sinai panin Topa ang pei a, Seir panin ni bangin eite tungah ang suoh hi. Paran Muol panin ama ang tang a, misiengtho tul tampite tawh ama omton hi; ama’ ziet lamah ama’ mihonpite om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi tahtah hi, mite lahah ang ki-angvan pa aw, nangma khut sungah ama’ misiengtho zosie a om hi; nangma kalsuonna zui-in amate ang pei vua, amate in nangma tung panin lamlahna a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jacob mihonte nei dingin Moses in thukham khat ko ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipi’ makaite kikhawmin Israel minam zosie a kikhop ciengun, Jeshurun ah kumpi khat a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’ mite a tawm vangun Reuben-te nungta hinlen, si vawt sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale ama in Judah thu ah tam bangin a gen hi: Topa aw, Judah’ aw ngai inlen, a mite kungah peipi in; ama adingin a khutte khausah inlen, a galte a dona ah a hupa-in pang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Levi thu ah tam bangin a gen hi: Levi tungah na Thummim pie inlen, na midih pa tungah na Urim pie in. Massah-a na zelah mi pa khu Meribah tuite-ah na kihaupi pa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a nu le a pa kungah, “Amate thuse sing,” a ci pa ahi hi: ama in a sanggamte thuse loin, a tate a nelsie hi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate in na thu a mang vua, na thuciemna zong a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in Jacob tungah na ngaina kipte a hil vua, Israel-te tungah na thukhamte a hil uhi; amate in na masangah panamtui a koi ding vua, na maitam tungah meihal biehna buppi a pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, ama’ nate thupha pie inlen, ama’ khutsuote sanpieh in; ama’ galte’ kawng hiatawng inlen, ama mudate a thokia zo lo dingin sugawp in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Benjamin thu ah: Topa in a it mipa hlamuongin a om hi. Sangpen Pasien in sun tungtawn ama kemin, ama in a liengko kikalah a it mipa a omsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Joseph thu ah: Topa in ama’ leitang, tung lama a om vantung letsong hoi pente le nei lam-a om tui thuhte tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ni hanga a pieng ga hoi pente le hla hanga a pieng a hoi pente tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tanglai muolte tunga a pieng a hoi a tuituoh pente le tawntung muolte’ hauna tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />leitunga letsong a hoi pente a dim le Sinai muol tunga a teng pa’ angvanna tung taheh. Joseph’ lu tungah tam teng zosie tung hinlen, a sanggam pasalte lahah ulien pa’ lu tungah tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawngtang bangin a tacil thahat hi! Ama’ ki, zangsiel’ ki tawh kibang hi; ama in tua a kite tawh mi pih ding a, leimong dongah amate a notmang ding hi; sim zawh lo Ephaim-te tua bang ahi a, sim zawh lo Manasseh-te zong tua bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in Zebulun thu ah: Zebulun aw, na pusuona-ah kipah in; Issachar aw, na puonbuh sungah kipah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a muol vuah mite a hlan ding uhi; amate in khum munah a man biehpiehna pie ding uhi; azieh pen amate in tuipi tung le senel tunga a kiphuol goute a ciemkha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in Gad thu ah: Gad a liensah pa in thupha nga taheh! Humpi bangin Gad a kuol hi; ama in a ban le a luzang a ehbal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in ama adingin mun hoipen a teel a,. azieh pen ama dingin a makaite’ tanh kikoi pieh hi; minam makaite’ ngaza ma ama zong kingasah a, ama in mipi makai semin, Topa’ thutang le Israel-te ading ngaina kipte a bawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in Dan thu ah: Dan pen Bashan pana dieng vazawh humpi no ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in Naphtali thu ah: Naphtali aw, maipha tawh nuomsa-in, a bukim Topa’ thupha nei inlen, na gam dingin tumlam le leitaw lam na nei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in Asher thu ah: Asher in tapa dangte sangin thupha nga zaw taheh. A sanggamte’ angvan hi hinlen, a gam sungah olive thau dimlet taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na kotgolh zawlte sia le sumngo tawh kibawl hi ding hi; na hin laisie-in na thahatna khu tua bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeshurun aw, nang ang hu dingin van tunga a tuong a lietna tawh vanpi-a om, Pasien tawh a kibang koima dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in tangtawng Pasien zo gawpin tanglai hatnate a vatmai a, na galte na mai-ah naw dawhin, “Susie un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te hlamuongin teng ding a, Jacob’ tenna mun pen a buoi sih ding hi. Vantung in van daitui a khiehna mun, an le lenggazu pienna gamah a teng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel aw, nang mi nuomsa na hi hi! Nang ang kipanpina lum le na guolzawna namsau ahi, Topa in nang banga a hutdam mi koi om ahei? Na galte in hing mai-etin, na kung ang pei ding vua, tuaci’n note in a elzang uh na tuoncil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moab zangleite panin Jericho tawh kigalsai Nebo Muol, Pisgah dawnah Moses a peito hi. Topa in gam zosie, Gilead panin Dan cieng dong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naphtali gam zosie, Ephraim gam le Manasseh gam, Judah gam zosie Nitumna lam Tuipi dong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Negeb le lutu kung khuopi kuom a kici Jericho panin Zoar cieng dong ama lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “Tam gam, keima in Abraham, Isaac le Jacob tungah kiciemin, ‘Na suon na hlahte tungah kang pie ding hi,’ ka ci leitang ahi hi; keima in na mit tawh kang musah zo ta a, hizongle khum munah na galkai sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ thupieh bangin Moab gam sungah Topa’ nasem Moses a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth-peor tawh kigalsai Moab gam kuom khatah ama kivui a, hinanle koima in tuni dongin a kivuina mun thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses a si-in kum za le kum sawmni pha hi; a mit miel nai loin a tha zong kie nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni sawmthum sung Israel-te in Moab zanglei-ah Moses a kaa uhi; tua ciengin Moses zieha kaana le mauna teng a veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in ama tungah a khut ngam zo ahi ziehin Nun’ tapa Joshua lungsim pilna tawh kidim hi; tuale Israel-te in ama’ thu a mang vua, Topa’ thupiehsa bangin a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mite sungah Moses banga Topa in kimaituo-a a thei kamsang dang koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt gam sungah Topa in Pharaoh le a nasem zosie le a gam buppi tungah lim le na lamdangte bawl dinga a sawl ama a dem zo koima a om sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in a thahat a nasepnate zosie le a zauhuoi a vanglietna a lahnate zosie, Israel mi zosie’ muna-a a bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
